export const PAGES = {"/camp":{"title":"해외캠프/유학 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>해외캠프/유학 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"어학연수·대학·학위유학·조기유학까지, 모든 해외캠프/유학 준비는 레벨업 유학원. 캐나다·뉴질랜드·영국·미국·일본 방학캠프 프로그램 안내.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/camp\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"해외캠프/유학 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"어학연수·대학·학위유학·조기유학까지, 모든 해외캠프/유학 준비는 레벨업 유학원. 캐나다·뉴질랜드·영국·미국·일본 방학캠프 프로그램 안내.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/camp\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"해외캠프/유학 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"어학연수·대학·학위유학·조기유학까지, 모든 해외캠프/유학 준비는 레벨업 유학원. 캐나다·뉴질랜드·영국·미국·일본 방학캠프 프로그램 안내.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"특별프로그램\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"해외캠프/유학\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/camp\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 해외캠프/유학 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/camp/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n  .k-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#99CFF9;padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .k-hero .pic{margin-top:24px}\n  .k-hero .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n  .k-hero .pic .m{display:none}\n\n  /* 방학캠프 프로그램 (아임웹 원본 커스텀 블록 스타일을 옮김) */\n  .camp{padding:90px 0 100px;--brand:#146AF0;--line:rgba(20,106,240,.14);--soft:#F7FBFF;--radius:22px;--shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(2,6,23,.06);--shadow2:0 22px 44px rgba(2,6,23,.12);--sub:#64748B}\n  .camp-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 22px;letter-spacing:-.02em;position:relative;padding-left:16px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .camp-title::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;bottom:8px;width:5px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand)}\n  .camp-row{display:flex;gap:26px;padding:18px;margin:16px 0;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,var(--soft));box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n  .camp-row:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow2);border-color:rgba(20,106,240,.35)}\n  .camp-img{width:520px;aspect-ratio:700/420;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 4px);overflow:hidden;background:#EEF2F7;position:relative}\n  .camp-img::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,6,23,0) 40%,rgba(2,6,23,.22) 100%);pointer-events:none}\n  .camp-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform:scale(1.02);transition:transform .35s ease;display:block}\n  .camp-row:hover .camp-img img{transform:scale(1.06)}\n  .camp-content{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:4px 2px}\n  .camp-content h3{margin:0;font-size:32px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink)}\n  .camp-loc{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:15px;color:var(--sub)}\n  .camp-meta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(20,106,240,.10);color:var(--brand);font-size:13px;font-weight:900;margin:4px 0 12px}\n  .camp-content ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.75;font-size:18px;color:#1F2937;list-style:disc}\n  .camp-content ul li{margin:6px 0}\n  .camp-content ul li::marker{color:rgba(20,106,240,.75)}\n  .camp-benefit{margin-top:28px;padding:40px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid rgba(20,106,240,.16);background:#F7FBFF;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(2,6,23,.06)}\n  .camp-benefit strong{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n  .camp-benefit strong::before{content:\"혜택\";display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}\n  .camp-benefit p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#334155}\n  .camp-benefit b{color:#0F172A;font-weight:900;background:rgba(20,106,240,.16);padding:0 4px;border-radius:6px}\n  .camp-note{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;color:rgba(15,23,42,.62)}\n\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .camp-img{width:380px} .camp-content h3{font-size:26px} .camp-content ul{font-size:16px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .k-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .k-hero .pic{margin-top:14px}\n    .k-hero .pic .pc{display:none}\n    .k-hero .pic .m{display:block}\n    .camp{padding:50px 0 60px}\n    .camp-title{font-size:22px}\n    .camp-row{flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:12px;align-items:stretch}\n    .camp-img{width:100%}\n    .camp-content{padding:4px 6px 8px}\n    .camp-content h3{font-size:24px}\n    .camp-content ul{font-size:15px}\n    .camp-benefit{padding:24px 20px}\n    .camp-benefit p{font-size:15px}\n    .camp-note{font-size:13px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 특별프로그램 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"k-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"특별프로그램\">\n      <a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pic\">\n    <img class=\"pc\" src=\"/img/camp/hero-pc.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"960\" alt=\"어학연수 / 대학 / 학위유학 / 조기유학. 모든 해외캠프/유학 준비는 레벨업 유학원. 상담 및 예약 문의 010-3038-8978\" />\n    <img class=\"m\" src=\"/img/camp/hero-m.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"800\" alt=\"어학연수 / 대학 / 학위유학 / 조기유학. 모든 해외캠프/유학 준비는 레벨업 유학원. 상담 및 예약 문의 010-3038-8978\" />\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 방학캠프 프로그램 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"camp\" id=\"camps\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"camp-title anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">방학캠프 프로그램</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-row anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"camp-img\"><img src=\"/img/camp/camp-1.jpg\" width=\"700\" height=\"420\" alt=\"캐나다 방학캠프\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"camp-content\">\n        <h3>캐나다</h3>\n        <p class=\"camp-loc\">온타리오주 나이아가라 폭포</p>\n        <p class=\"camp-meta\">만 10세~17세 · 3주</p>\n        <ul><li>캐나다 공립학교 영어 학습</li><li>다양한 액티비티 및 현지 문화 체험</li><li>토론토 · 나이아가라 폭포 · 원더랜드 · 사파리 투어</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-row anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"camp-img\"><img src=\"/img/camp/camp-2.jpg\" width=\"700\" height=\"420\" alt=\"뉴질랜드 방학캠프\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"camp-content\">\n        <h3>뉴질랜드</h3>\n        <p class=\"camp-loc\">오클랜드 · 와이우쿠 (Waiuku)</p>\n        <p class=\"camp-meta\">만 10세~17세 · 3주</p>\n        <ul><li>뉴질랜드 공립학교 정규과정 참여</li><li>유학생활 체험 · 액티비티</li><li>호빗튼 세트장 · 럭비 경기 · 마오리 문화 체험</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-row anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"camp-img\"><img src=\"/img/camp/camp-3.jpg\" width=\"700\" height=\"420\" alt=\"영국 방학캠프\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"camp-content\">\n        <h3>영국</h3>\n        <p class=\"camp-loc\">런던 (UCL 연계)</p>\n        <p class=\"camp-meta\">만 12세~17세 · 3주</p>\n        <ul><li>영어 집중 학습 및 액티비티</li><li>런던 명문대 UCL 프로그램</li><li>프랑스 · 독일 · 체코 1주 유럽 탐방</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-row anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"camp-img\"><img src=\"/img/camp/camp-4.jpg\" width=\"700\" height=\"420\" alt=\"미국 방학캠프\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"camp-content\">\n        <h3>미국</h3>\n        <p class=\"camp-loc\">캘리포니아 패서디나 (Pasadena)</p>\n        <p class=\"camp-meta\">2주 / 3주 선택</p>\n        <ul><li>영어 학습 + 글로벌 문화 체험</li><li>디즈니랜드 · 유니버설 스튜디오</li><li>그리피스 천문대 · 할리우드 방문</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-row anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"camp-img\"><img src=\"/img/camp/camp-5.jpg\" width=\"700\" height=\"420\" alt=\"일본 방학캠프\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"camp-content\">\n        <h3>일본</h3>\n        <p class=\"camp-loc\">교토 · 오사카</p>\n        <p class=\"camp-meta\">만 14세~18세 · 2주</p>\n        <ul><li>일본어 학습 및 현지 문화 체험</li><li>교토 · 오사카 주요 명소 탐방</li><li>유니버설 스튜디오 방문</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"camp-benefit anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <strong>🎁 조기 마감 혜택 안내</strong>\n      <p>매 시즌 빠르게 마감되는 인기 캠프입니다.<br /><b>얼리버드 등록 시 우선 선발 혜택</b> 제공<br />형제·자매 동시 등록 시 <b>추가 지원 혜택</b> 제공</p>\n      <span class=\"camp-note\">※ 혜택은 선착순 적용되며 중복 적용은 불가합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"해외캠프/유학\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_camp_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_camp_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_camp_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_camp_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\" checked>해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_camp_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_camp_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_camp_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_camp_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_camp_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_camp_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/chinese-business":{"title":"비즈니스 중국어 과외 | 직장인·여행 중국어 회화 1:1 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>비즈니스 중국어 과외 | 직장인·여행 중국어 회화 1:1 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 중국어 1:1 과외. 거래처 전화·이메일·회의·출장 중국어와 여행 중국어를 실제 상황으로 연습. 중국 주재원·무역·관광 업무 대비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-business\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"비즈니스 중국어 과외 | 직장인·여행 중국어 회화 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 중국어 1:1 과외. 거래처 전화·이메일·회의·출장 중국어와 여행 중국어를 실제 상황으로 연습. 중국 주재원·무역·관광 업무 대비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-business\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"비즈니스 중국어 과외 | 직장인·여행 중국어 회화 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 중국어 1:1 과외. 거래처 전화·이메일·회의·출장 중국어와 여행 중국어를 실제 상황으로 연습. 중국 주재원·무역·관광 업무 대비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"중국어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-business\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"중국어 기초가 없어도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"병음·성조와 기본 문형을 4~6주 먼저 잡고 비즈니스 과정으로 넘어갑니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"여행 중국어만 단기로 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"가능합니다. 출발 전 2~4주, 주 2~3회 집중 과정으로 준비합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"회사 자료로 수업할 수 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 실제 메일·자료를 가져오시면 그걸로 연습합니다. 대외비는 가려서 주시면 됩니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"BCT(비즈니스 중국어 시험) 대비도 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. BCT 목표 등급에 맞춘 듣기·독해 과정이 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외\", \"description\": \"직장인 비즈니스 중국어 1:1 과외. 거래처 전화·이메일·회의·출장 중국어와 여행 중국어를 실제 상황으로 연습. 중국 주재원·무역·관광 업무 대비, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화</a> › <span>비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Business Chinese</span>\n        <h1>비즈니스·여행 중국어 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">중국 거래처와 일하거나 출장이 잦은 분을 위한 실무 중국어입니다. 인사·명함 교환부터 전화, 이메일(위챗 포함), 회의, 협상, 접대까지 본인 업무 상황을 가져와 연습합니다. 출장·여행이 목적이면 공항·호텔·식당·교통 표현을 2~4주에 집중해서 잡습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/cn/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국 거래처와 소통하는 무역·구매·영업 직장인</b><p>견적·납기·품질 관련 표현과 위챗 메시지 작성을 연습합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국 주재원·파견을 앞둔 분</b><p>부임 후 첫 3개월에 필요한 회의·보고·생활 중국어를 집중합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국 출장·여행이 잦은 분</b><p>이동·숙박·식사·쇼핑·긴급 상황 표현을 짧은 기간에 잡습니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>업무 상황 파악</b><p>상대(거래처·동료·고객)와 업무(전화·메일·회의)를 정리하고 우선순위를 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>핵심 표현 정리</b><p>업종별 필수 표현 200개와 정중한 말투(您, 请, 麻烦)를 먼저 익힙니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>롤플레이</b><p>전화 응대, 회의 발언, 거래처 방문을 원어민 선생님과 실제처럼 연습합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>실무 첨삭</b><p>본인이 쓴 메일·메시지를 첨삭하고 자연스러운 표현으로 바꿉니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>기초</td><td>비즈니스 인사, 명함, 자기소개, 숫자·날짜·가격</td><td>첫 만남과 기본 협의</td></tr><tr><td>전화·메시지</td><td>전화 응대, 위챗·이메일 관용구, 일정 조율</td><td>연락 혼자 처리</td></tr><tr><td>회의·협상</td><td>회의 진행, 제안·반대, 가격·납기 협상 표현</td><td>회의에서 발언하기</td></tr><tr><td>출장·여행</td><td>공항·호텔·식당·교통, 접대·감사 표현</td><td>출장 일정 전체 대응</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">중국어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/chinese#teachers\">중국어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>중국어 기초가 없어도 되나요?</summary><p>병음·성조와 기본 문형을 4~6주 먼저 잡고 비즈니스 과정으로 넘어갑니다.</p></details><details><summary>여행 중국어만 단기로 되나요?</summary><p>가능합니다. 출발 전 2~4주, 주 2~3회 집중 과정으로 준비합니다.</p></details><details><summary>회사 자료로 수업할 수 있나요?</summary><p>네. 실제 메일·자료를 가져오시면 그걸로 연습합니다. 대외비는 가려서 주시면 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>BCT(비즈니스 중국어 시험) 대비도 하나요?</summary><p>네. BCT 목표 등급에 맞춘 듣기·독해 과정이 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>중국어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/chinese-online\">화상 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-hsk\">HSK·TSC 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-kids\">어린이·초등 중국어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"비즈니스 중국어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesebusiness_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_chinesebusiness_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesebusiness_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_chinesebusiness_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_chinesebusiness_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_chinesebusiness_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_chinesebusiness_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_chinesebusiness_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_chinesebusiness_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_chinesebusiness_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/chinese-hsk":{"title":"HSK·TSC 과외 | 급수별 1:1 시험 대비 (HSK 4급·5급·6급) - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>HSK·TSC 과외 | 급수별 1:1 시험 대비 (HSK 4급·5급·6급) - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"HSK 4급·5급·6급, HSKK, TSC 목표 1:1 과외. 듣기·독해·쓰기 영역별 진단, 급수별 어휘·문법 범위 정리와 기출 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·내신 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-hsk\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"HSK·TSC 과외 | 급수별 1:1 시험 대비 (HSK 4급·5급·6급) - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"HSK 4급·5급·6급, HSKK, TSC 목표 1:1 과외. 듣기·독해·쓰기 영역별 진단, 급수별 어휘·문법 범위 정리와 기출 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·내신 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-hsk\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"HSK·TSC 과외 | 급수별 1:1 시험 대비 (HSK 4급·5급·6급) - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"HSK 4급·5급·6급, HSKK, TSC 목표 1:1 과외. 듣기·독해·쓰기 영역별 진단, 급수별 어휘·문법 범위 정리와 기출 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·내신 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"중국어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"HSK·TSC 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-hsk\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"HSK 5급까지 얼마나 걸리나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"4급에서 5급은 3~4개월, 처음 시작해 5급까지는 8~10개월을 보통 잡습니다. 주 2회 기준입니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"쓰기 영역은 어떻게 준비하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"매주 작문 2편을 첨삭하고, 6급은 요약 쓰기 훈련을 따로 합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"고등학교 중국어 내신도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 학교 교과서 진도에 맞춘 내신 대비와 HSK를 병행하는 학생이 있습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"교재는요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"급수별 종합서와 기출문제집을 기본으로, 어휘는 선생님이 정리한 급수별 단어장을 씁니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"HSK·TSC 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"HSK·TSC 과외\", \"description\": \"HSK 4급·5급·6급, HSKK, TSC 목표 1:1 과외. 듣기·독해·쓰기 영역별 진단, 급수별 어휘·문법 범위 정리와 기출 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·내신 대비, 무료 체험.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: HSK·TSC 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화</a> › <span>HSK·TSC 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">HSK · TSC</span>\n        <h1>HSK·TSC <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">HSK는 급수별 필수 어휘가 정해져 있어 범위를 알고 준비하면 점수가 빨리 오릅니다. 듣기·독해·쓰기 3영역을 진단하고 약한 영역을 집중하며, 시험 4주 전부터는 기출 모의고사로 시간 감각을 맞춥니다. 말하기 시험(TSC·HSKK)은 원어민 선생님과 유형별 답변 훈련을 합니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/cn/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"HSK·TSC 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>취업·승진에 HSK 5급 이상이 필요한 분</b><p>시험일까지 주 3~4회 집중 과정으로 어휘 2,500개와 쓰기를 잡습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>HSK 4급까지 왔는데 5급 독해에서 막힌 분</b><p>5급부터는 독해 속도가 관건입니다. 지문 유형별 시간 전략을 훈련합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>TSC·HSKK 말하기 등급이 필요한 분</b><p>유형별 답변 구조와 녹음 첨삭으로 목표 등급을 준비합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>모의 진단</b><p>급수별 축약 모의고사로 영역별 정답률과 약점을 확인합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>범위 배분</b><p>급수 필수 어휘·문법을 주 단위로 나눠 암기 확인과 쓰기 연습을 병행합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>영역별 수업</b><p>듣기는 원어민 받아쓰기, 독해는 시간 전략, 쓰기는 첨삭 중심으로 진행합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>모의고사 관리</b><p>시험 4주 전부터 매주 풀세트 모의고사로 점수 추이를 관리합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>HSK 3·4급</td><td>어휘 1,200, 기본 문법, 짧은 듣기·독해</td><td>4급 합격(180+)</td></tr><tr><td>HSK 5급</td><td>어휘 2,500, 장문 독해 전략, 작문(80자)</td><td>5급 합격(180+)</td></tr><tr><td>HSK 6급</td><td>어휘 5,000, 요약 쓰기(缩写), 고난도 독해</td><td>6급 합격</td></tr><tr><td>TSC·HSKK</td><td>유형별 답변 구조, 발음·성조, 녹음 첨삭</td><td>TSC 4급+ / HSKK 중급+</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">중국어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/chinese#teachers\">중국어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>HSK 5급까지 얼마나 걸리나요?</summary><p>4급에서 5급은 3~4개월, 처음 시작해 5급까지는 8~10개월을 보통 잡습니다. 주 2회 기준입니다.</p></details><details><summary>쓰기 영역은 어떻게 준비하나요?</summary><p>매주 작문 2편을 첨삭하고, 6급은 요약 쓰기 훈련을 따로 합니다.</p></details><details><summary>고등학교 중국어 내신도 되나요?</summary><p>네. 학교 교과서 진도에 맞춘 내신 대비와 HSK를 병행하는 학생이 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>교재는요?</summary><p>급수별 종합서와 기출문제집을 기본으로, 어휘는 선생님이 정리한 급수별 단어장을 씁니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>중국어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/chinese-online\">화상 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-business\">비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-kids\">어린이·초등 중국어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"HSK·TSC\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesehsk_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_chinesehsk_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesehsk_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_chinesehsk_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_chinesehsk_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_chinesehsk_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_chinesehsk_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_chinesehsk_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_chinesehsk_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_chinesehsk_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/chinese-kids":{"title":"어린이·초등 중국어 과외 | 1:1 화상 중국어 첫걸음 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>어린이·초등 중국어 과외 | 1:1 화상 중국어 첫걸음 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 중국어 1:1 화상 과외. 병음·성조를 노래와 놀이로, 그림책과 역할놀이로 말하기 중심. 어린이 중국어 지도사 선생님, 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 무료 체험.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-kids\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"어린이·초등 중국어 과외 | 1:1 화상 중국어 첫걸음 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 중국어 1:1 화상 과외. 병음·성조를 노래와 놀이로, 그림책과 역할놀이로 말하기 중심. 어린이 중국어 지도사 선생님, 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-kids\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"어린이·초등 중국어 과외 | 1:1 화상 중국어 첫걸음 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 중국어 1:1 화상 과외. 병음·성조를 노래와 놀이로, 그림책과 역할놀이로 말하기 중심. 어린이 중국어 지도사 선생님, 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"중국어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"어린이·초등 중국어 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-kids\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"몇 살부터 가능한가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"5세부터 가능합니다. 집중 시간이 짧은 유아는 25분 수업으로 시작합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"원어민 선생님인가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"한국어가 가능한 중국인 선생님 또는 어린이 중국어 지도사 자격이 있는 한국인 선생님 중 고를 수 있습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"한자는 언제부터 배우나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"말하기가 어느 정도 되는 Step 3부터 자주 쓰는 한자 100자를 시작합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"YCT 시험도 준비되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 어린이 중국어 시험 YCT 2~3급을 목표로 하는 과정이 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"어린이·초등 중국어 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"어린이·초등 중국어 과외\", \"description\": \"유아·초등 어린이 중국어 1:1 화상 과외. 병음·성조를 노래와 놀이로, 그림책과 역할놀이로 말하기 중심. 어린이 중국어 지도사 선생님, 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 무료 체험.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 어린이·초등 중국어 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화</a> › <span>어린이·초등 중국어 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Kids Chinese</span>\n        <h1>어린이·초등 <em>중국어 과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">아이는 성조를 소리로 그대로 따라 합니다. 이 시기에 원어민 소리로 시작하면 발음이 자연스럽게 잡힙니다. 노래, 그림책, 역할놀이로 중국어를 &#x27;말&#x27;로 만나게 하고, 초등 고학년은 병음 읽기와 한자 쓰기까지 단계적으로 넓힙니다. 어린이 중국어 지도 경험이 있는 선생님이 맡습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/cn/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"어린이·초등 중국어 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국어를 처음 접하는 5~8세</b><p>소리 놀이와 노래로 성조에 익숙해지는 단계부터 시작합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>초등 중국어 방과후·학원 보충이 필요한 아이</b><p>단어는 아는데 말이 안 나오는 아이. 1:1이라 말할 기회가 수업 내내 있습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국 국제학교·이주를 준비하는 가정</b><p>학교 생활에 필요한 표현과 기초 한자를 함께 준비합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>성향·레벨 확인</b><p>아이가 좋아하는 것을 먼저 듣고, 20분 놀이 수업으로 소리 반응과 수준을 봅니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>교재·주제 선택</b><p>그림책, 노래, 아이 관심사 주제를 섞어 4주 계획을 짭니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>25~40분, 화면 카드와 그림으로 말하기 중심. 매 수업 새 표현 5개를 소리 내어 말합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>부모 리포트</b><p>수업 후 오늘 배운 표현과 집에서 3분 해볼 활동을 문자로 보내드립니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Step 1</td><td>병음·성조 소리 놀이, 인사, 숫자·색깔</td><td>단어를 듣고 따라 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 2</td><td>그림책 읽기, 일상 표현, 짧은 질문·대답</td><td>3~4단어 문장으로 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 3</td><td>이야기 다시 말하기, 기초 한자 100자</td><td>한 가지 주제로 5문장 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 4</td><td>YCT 대비, 짧은 일기 쓰기, 발표</td><td>YCT 2~3급 · 자기 생각 말하기</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">중국어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/chinese#teachers\">중국어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>몇 살부터 가능한가요?</summary><p>5세부터 가능합니다. 집중 시간이 짧은 유아는 25분 수업으로 시작합니다.</p></details><details><summary>원어민 선생님인가요?</summary><p>한국어가 가능한 중국인 선생님 또는 어린이 중국어 지도사 자격이 있는 한국인 선생님 중 고를 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>한자는 언제부터 배우나요?</summary><p>말하기가 어느 정도 되는 Step 3부터 자주 쓰는 한자 100자를 시작합니다.</p></details><details><summary>YCT 시험도 준비되나요?</summary><p>네. 어린이 중국어 시험 YCT 2~3급을 목표로 하는 과정이 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>중국어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/chinese-online\">화상 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-hsk\">HSK·TSC 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-business\">비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"어린이 중국어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesekids_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_chinesekids_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinesekids_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_chinesekids_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_chinesekids_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_chinesekids_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_chinesekids_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_chinesekids_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_chinesekids_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_chinesekids_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/chinese-online":{"title":"화상 중국어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 중국어 회화 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>화상 중국어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 중국어 회화 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 중국어 회화. 성조·발음부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·비즈니스·HSK 병행 가능. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-online\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"화상 중국어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 중국어 회화 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 중국어 회화. 성조·발음부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·비즈니스·HSK 병행 가능. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-online\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"화상 중국어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 중국어 회화 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 중국어 회화. 성조·발음부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·비즈니스·HSK 병행 가능. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"중국어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"화상 중국어 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese-online\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"한자를 몰라도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"처음에는 병음으로 말하기부터 하고, 한자는 자주 쓰는 300자부터 단계적으로 익힙니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"원어민 선생님과 한국어로 소통되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 한국어가 가능한 중국인 선생님이 맡아 설명은 한국어로, 연습은 중국어로 합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"수업 시간과 횟수는요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"회당 40·50분, 주 1~3회. 평일 저녁·주말 가능합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"HSK도 같이 준비되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"회화와 HSK를 병행하거나 시험 전 HSK 집중 과정으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"화상 중국어 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"화상 중국어 과외\", \"description\": \"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 중국어 회화. 성조·발음부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·비즈니스·HSK 병행 가능. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 화상 중국어 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화</a> › <span>화상 중국어 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Online Chinese</span>\n        <h1>화상 중국어 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">중국어는 성조와 발음을 처음에 정확히 잡아야 이후가 편합니다. 한국어가 가능한 중국인 원어민 선생님과 1:1 화상으로 발음부터 교정하고, 일상 회화·여행·비즈니스 등 목표에 맞는 소재로 말하기 중심 수업을 합니다. HSK와 병행도 됩니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/cn/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"화상 중국어 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국어를 처음 시작하는 분</b><p>병음·성조·기본 문형을 8주 입문 과정으로 잡습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>학원에서 배웠지만 발음이 자신 없는 분</b><p>원어민이 매 수업 성조와 발음을 교정합니다. 녹음 비교로 변화를 확인합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>중국 출장·여행·유학을 앞둔 분</b><p>공항·식당·택시·호텔·거래처 상황을 그대로 연습합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>레벨 진단</b><p>발음·성조·기본 대화를 확인하고 선생님(원어민·한국인)을 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>목표 설정</b><p>일상 회화, 여행, 비즈니스, HSK 중 목표를 정하고 첫 달 계획을 짭니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>줌으로 교재와 자료를 띄워 말하기 중심으로. 수업 후 발음 교정 음성과 노트를 받습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>월 점검</b><p>월말 프리토킹 녹음으로 성조·유창성 변화를 확인하고 다음 달 목표를 정합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>입문</td><td>병음·성조, 인사, 숫자, 기본 문형</td><td>자기소개와 간단한 질문</td></tr><tr><td>초급</td><td>일상 회화 100문장, 쇼핑·식당·길 묻기</td><td>여행에서 필요한 말 하기</td></tr><tr><td>중급</td><td>의견 말하기, 드라마·뉴스 소재, 관용 표현</td><td>10분 이상 대화</td></tr><tr><td>고급</td><td>프리토킹, 시사 토론, 비즈니스 표현</td><td>원어민과 자연스러운 대화</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">중국어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/chinese#teachers\">중국어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"중국어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>한자를 몰라도 되나요?</summary><p>처음에는 병음으로 말하기부터 하고, 한자는 자주 쓰는 300자부터 단계적으로 익힙니다.</p></details><details><summary>원어민 선생님과 한국어로 소통되나요?</summary><p>네. 한국어가 가능한 중국인 선생님이 맡아 설명은 한국어로, 연습은 중국어로 합니다.</p></details><details><summary>수업 시간과 횟수는요?</summary><p>회당 40·50분, 주 1~3회. 평일 저녁·주말 가능합니다.</p></details><details><summary>HSK도 같이 준비되나요?</summary><p>회화와 HSK를 병행하거나 시험 전 HSK 집중 과정으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>중국어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/chinese\">중국어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/chinese-hsk\">HSK·TSC 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-business\">비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-kids\">어린이·초등 중국어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"화상 중국어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chineseonline_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_chineseonline_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chineseonline_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_chineseonline_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_chineseonline_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_chineseonline_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_chineseonline_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_chineseonline_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_chineseonline_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_chineseonline_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/chinese":{"title":"중국어 회화 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>중국어 회화 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"지금이 바로 중국어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! HSK·TSC·비즈니스·내신 대비까지 1:1 중국어 학습 프로그램. 원어민·전공 강사진이 발음부터 차근차근 지도합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"중국어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 중국어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! HSK·TSC·비즈니스·내신 대비까지 1:1 중국어 학습 프로그램. 원어민·전공 강사진이 발음부터 차근차근 지도합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"중국어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 중국어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! HSK·TSC·비즈니스·내신 대비까지 1:1 중국어 학습 프로그램. 원어민·전공 강사진이 발음부터 차근차근 지도합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"외국어\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"중국어\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/chinese\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 중국어 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/cn/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3;--sky:#6AB9F7}\n  .l-kicker{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sky)}\n  .x-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .x-hero .txt{text-align:center;margin-top:60px}\n  .x-hero .txt .sm{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:60px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);margin-top:10px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .35s both}\n  .x-hero .txt h1.dark{color:var(--ink)}\n  .x-hero .txt h1.dark em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .x-hero .pics{display:grid;gap:24px;margin-top:50px}\n  .x-hero .pics.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .x-hero .pics img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .x-sec{padding:120px 0}\n  .x-keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}\n  .x-keys img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .x-keys .row3{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\n  .x-prog{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .x-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:900px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);max-width:1000px}\n  .x-tiles img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 14px 28px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .25s}\n  .x-tiles img:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .l-more{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px}\n  .l-more a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:46px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid var(--blue);background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n  .l-more a:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .x-teachers{background:#BADEFB}\n  .t-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:60px}\n  .t-card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 22px 28px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(33,150,243,.4);transition:transform .3s}\n  .t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}\n  .t-card img{width:120px;height:162px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;margin:0 auto 14px}\n  .t-card h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .t-card .school{font-size:14px;color:#666;margin-top:4px;min-height:42px}\n  .t-card dl{margin:14px 0 0;text-align:left}\n  .t-card dt{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--blue);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;margin:10px 0 6px}\n  .t-card dd{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-2);word-break:keep-all}\n  .x-divider{margin-top:60px}\n  .x-divider img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;opacity:.9}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:46px} .t-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)} .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .l-kicker{font-size:15px}\n    .x-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .x-hero .txt{margin-top:34px}\n    .x-hero .txt .sm{font-size:18px}\n    .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:28px}\n    .x-hero .pics,.x-hero .pics.two{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}\n    .x-hero .pics img{border-radius:14px}\n    .x-sec{padding:70px 0}\n    .x-keys{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\n    .x-keys .row3{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\n    .x-tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:30px}\n    .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n    .t-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}\n    .t-card{padding:18px 14px 20px;border-radius:14px}\n    .t-card img{width:90px;height:121px}\n    .t-card h3{font-size:18px}\n    .t-card .school{font-size:12px;min-height:0}\n    .t-card dd{font-size:13px}\n    .x-divider{margin-top:34px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 외국어 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"외국어\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></nav>\n    <div class=\"txt\">\n      <p class=\"sm\">现在就一起踏上中文进阶之旅吧!</p>\n      <h1 class=\"dark\">지금이 바로<br /><em>중국어 실력 레벨업</em> 타이밍!</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pics two\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeIn\" src=\"/img/cn/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"헤드폰을 쓰고 노트북으로 중국어 화상 수업을 듣는 학생\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.15s\" src=\"/img/cn/hero-2.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"중국어 수업 모습\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 1:1 중국어 학습 프로그램 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-sec x-prog\" id=\"program\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">1:1 중국어<br /><em>학습 프로그램</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"x-tiles sq\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-1.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 1\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-2.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-3.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-4.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-5.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 5\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-6.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 6\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-7.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 7\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/cn/tile-8.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" alt=\"중국어 학습 프로그램 8\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l-more\"><a href=\"#contact\">더보기</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 선생님 소개 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-sec x-teachers\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">擁有多年教學經驗的專業老師</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">믿고 배우는 중국어,<br /><em>레벨업의 선생님</em>을 소개합니다!</h2>\n    <div class=\"t-grid\">\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"김선형 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>김선형</h3><p class=\"school\">푸단 대학교(중국 언어 문학과 졸업예정)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>HSK / 표준 중국어 회화 / 중고등 내신 대비</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국문화 베이스로 중국어와 중국문화로 가득 채운 강사 / 명확한 표준 중국어 발음과 1대1 눈높이 수업가능 / 발랄하고 재미 있는 수업으로 회원의 동기부여 창출</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"소화윤 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>소화윤</h3><p class=\"school\">中国大连理工大学 졸업 / 중국 원어민</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>HSK / 중국 대학 입시 준비 / 외고 내신 대비</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>표준 중국어 발음 / 3개월 끝말 없이 왕초보도 2개월부터 문장 말하기 가능 / 학생에게 만족과 신뢰를 드리는 코치 / 유아 기초 / 중 고등 내신 / 어휘 / 문법 / 성인 고급 레벨 중국어</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"도홍화 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>도홍화</h3><p class=\"school\">중국 한일번사범대학원 졸업 / 중국 원어민</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>新HSK(16) / TSC / 비즈니스 중국어 / 문법</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>피복 차이나 코치로 근무 경력 / 재미있고 수준 넘기지 않는 교재로, 최고의 멘토 / 부드럽지만 정확한 발음과 인내심으로 끝까지 학습을 함께하는 코치 / 1:1 학생 눈높이 맞춤 수업 진행</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"하지영 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>하지영</h3><p class=\"school\">이화여대 통번역대학원 한중 전공 졸업</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>초급, 중급, 고급 중국어 / HSK / TSC</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>『동화로 배우는 중국어』 책 저자 / 초등 등 좋아하는 컨텐츠로 쉽고 재밌게 배우는 중국어 / 업무에 자신감을 갖게 해주는 비즈니스 중국어 / 목적과 목표에 맞춘 활용도 높은 중국어 수업</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-5.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"김혜린 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>김혜린</h3><p class=\"school\">중국 연변 대학(경영학) / 중국 국적 원어민</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>HSK / TSC / 비즈니스 중국어 / 관광중국어</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>쉽게 가르치는 원어민 코치와 함께하는 수업 / 중국어 발음부터 차근차근 시작 / 실생활에 쓰이는 유용한 표준어 회화</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-6.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"장리 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>장리</h3><p class=\"school\">중국 천진(노래내과) / 어린이 중국어 지도사</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>초,중,고급,어린이 중국어 / HSK / TSC</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>중국어 성조와 발음을 체계적으로 배울 수 있는 수업 진행 / 수업시간에 재미있게 중국어로 많이 소통할 수 있는 수업 진행 / 중국어를 실습하고 즐겁게 배울 수 있는 수업 진행</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-7.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"스민 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>스민</h3><p class=\"school\">부산대 교육대학원 교육학과 석사 / 원어민</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>HSK / TSC / 항공사중국어 / 의료관광중국어</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>흥미롭게 수업 진행하고 중국 원어민 발음 지도 / 한국어로 자세한 문법 설명 가능 / 꼼꼼하고 정확한 중국어 의사 전달 지도 / 학생 맞춤 눈높이 수업 진행</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/cn/teacher-8.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"장이링 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>장이링</h3><p class=\"school\">대련 풍엽국제학교 졸업 / 한자교육지도사</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>여행 중국어 / 생활 중국어 / 중국어 회화</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>쉽게 가르치는 원어민 강사와 함께하는 수업 / 중국어 발음부터 차근차근 시작 / 실생활에 쓰이는 유용한 중국어 회화 / 따라만 해도 쉽고 빠르게 중국어 마스터</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"x-divider\"><img src=\"/img/cn/divider.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"57\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 관련 수업 (키워드 페이지) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-alt\" id=\"related\"><div class=\"rel-box\" style=\"padding-top:70px\"><h2 class=\"s-h2\">목적별 <em>중국어 수업</em> 바로가기</h2><div class=\"kw-rel\"><a href=\"/chinese-online\">화상 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-hsk\">HSK·TSC 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-business\">비즈니스·여행 중국어 과외</a><a href=\"/chinese-kids\">어린이·초등 중국어 과외</a></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"중국어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinese_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_chinese_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_chinese_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_chinese_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_chinese_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_chinese_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_chinese_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_chinese_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_chinese_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_chinese_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/coaching":{"title":"학습코칭 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>학습코칭 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"목표 설정, 플랜, 루틴까지 맞춤 설계. 학습 전문 코치의 1:1 온라인 코칭으로 나에게 꼭 맞는 공부 방향을 찾고 끝까지 완주합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/coaching\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"학습코칭 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"목표 설정, 플랜, 루틴까지 맞춤 설계. 학습 전문 코치의 1:1 온라인 코칭으로 나에게 꼭 맞는 공부 방향을 찾고 끝까지 완주합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/coaching\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"학습코칭 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"목표 설정, 플랜, 루틴까지 맞춤 설계. 학습 전문 코치의 1:1 온라인 코칭으로 나에게 꼭 맞는 공부 방향을 찾고 끝까지 완주합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"학습코칭\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/coaching\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 학습코칭 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/coaching/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#7E57C2}\n  .c-hero{position:relative;margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:110px 0 470px;background:#474771 url(\"/img/coaching/hero-pc.jpg\") 50% 100%/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .c-hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(40,40,80,.35),rgba(40,40,80,0) 55%)}\n  .c-hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .c-hero h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .c-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#C4B2E3;display:block}\n  .c-hero p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:28px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .4s both}\n\n  .c-sec{padding:120px 0}\n\n  /* 프로그램 */\n  .c-program{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .c-program .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 6fr;gap:60px;align-items:start}\n  .c-program .photo{position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden}\n  .c-program .photo img{width:100%;height:auto}\n  .c-program .tags{position:absolute;left:20px;top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n  .c-program .tags span{display:inline-block;background:var(--purple);color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px}\n  .c-list{margin-top:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px}\n  .c-list li{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}\n  .c-list img{width:32px;height:32px;flex:0 0 32px;margin-top:4px}\n  .c-list b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:4px}\n  .c-list p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .c-routine{margin-top:120px}\n  .c-plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;margin-top:50px}\n  .c-plans img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -24px rgba(60,40,120,.35)}\n\n  /* 이런 학생에게 */\n  .c-who .c-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;margin-top:60px}\n  .c-who .c-card{text-align:center;padding:36px 20px;border-radius:24px;background:#F7F8F9}\n  .c-who .c-card img{width:160px;height:160px;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .c-who .c-card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .c-who .c-card b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-top:10px}\n  .c-who .types{margin-top:60px}\n  .c-who .types img{width:100%;height:auto}\n  .c-video{margin-top:60px;position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}\n  .c-video iframe,.c-video img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;object-fit:cover}\n  .c-video button{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.15);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .25s}\n  .c-video button:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .c-video button span{width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .c-video button span::after{content:\"\";margin-left:6px;border-left:26px solid var(--purple);border-top:16px solid transparent;border-bottom:16px solid transparent}\n\n  /* 전문가 */\n  .c-expert{background:#F2EEF9}\n  .c-expert .icon{width:120px;height:120px;margin:0 auto 20px}\n  .c-expert .people{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;margin-top:60px}\n  .c-expert .person{text-align:center}\n  .c-expert .person img{width:240px;height:160px;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .c-expert .person p{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .c-expert .person b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-top:6px}\n  .c-expert .divider{margin:80px 0 60px}\n  .c-expert .divider img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n  .c-reviews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:50px}\n  .c-reviews img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px}\n\n\n\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .c-hero h1{font-size:42px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .c-hero{padding:60px 0 240px;background-image:url(\"/img/coaching/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 100%;background-size:100% auto}\n        .c-hero h1{font-size:26px}\n    .c-hero p{font-size:15px;margin-top:16px}\n    .c-sec{padding:70px 0}\n    .c-program .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}\n    .c-program .tags span{font-size:14px;padding:6px 12px}\n    .c-list{margin-top:28px;gap:20px}\n    .c-list b{font-size:19px}\n    .c-list p{font-size:15px}\n    .c-routine{margin-top:70px}\n    .c-plans{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}\n    .c-who .c-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:34px}\n    .c-who .c-card{padding:26px 16px}\n    .c-who .c-card img{width:120px;height:120px}\n    .c-who .c-card b{font-size:19px}\n    .c-who .types{margin-top:34px;overflow-x:auto}\n    .c-who .types img{min-width:700px}\n    .c-video{margin-top:34px;border-radius:14px}\n    .c-video button span{width:64px;height:64px}\n    .c-expert .icon{width:80px;height:80px}\n    .c-expert .people{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:34px}\n    .c-expert .person img{width:180px;height:120px}\n    .c-expert .divider{margin:50px 0 30px}\n    .c-reviews{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 학습코칭 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"c-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>공부의 올바른 방향을 더하다 레벨업 코칭수업<em>목표 설정, 플랜, 루틴까지 맞춤 설계.</em></h1>\n    <p>레벨업 코칭 수업이 나에게 꼭 맞는 학습 방향을 찾고,<br />끝까지 완주할 수 있도록 도와드립니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 코칭 프로그램 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"c-sec c-program\" id=\"program\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"photo anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\">\n        <img src=\"/img/coaching/program.jpg\" width=\"648\" height=\"608\" alt=\"1:1 학습 코칭 수업 모습\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"tags\"><span>대상: 초등학생~고등학생</span><span>방식: 1:1 온라인 수업</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">진학으로 연결되는<br /><em>진로 맞춤 코칭</em></h2>\n        <ul class=\"c-list\">\n          <li class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/icon-1.png\" alt=\"\" /><div><b>스타트 체크</b><p>학습에 영향을 주는 네가지 핵심 영역 분석으로 학생의 강점과 약점 파악</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.08s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/icon-2.png\" alt=\"\" /><div><b>맞춤형 커리큘럼 사례</b><p>맞춤 커리큘럼 설계 영향을 주는 네가지 핵심 영역 분석으로 학생의 강점과 약점 파악</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.16s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/icon-3.png\" alt=\"\" /><div><b>1:1 맞춤 코칭</b><p>라이브로 진행되는 생활습관/학습법/진로/플랜 코칭</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.24s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/icon-4.png\" alt=\"\" /><div><b>실행력을 높이는 플래닝</b><p>해야할 일과 하고 싶은 일을 구별하는 자기주도학습의 키</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.32s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/icon-5.png\" alt=\"\" /><div><b>학습 전문 코치의 FULL CARE</b><p>공부에 대한 고민, 공부가 아닌 고민도 모두 케어하는 학습 전문 코치</p></div></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"c-routine center\">\n      <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">나에게 <em>딱 맞는 공부 루틴</em> 찾기</h2>\n      <p class=\"s-sub anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">학습 전문 코치가 혼자서도 끝까지 해내는 공부 습관 만들기를 도와드립니다.</p>\n      <div class=\"c-plans\">\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" src=\"/img/coaching/plan-1.png\" width=\"710\" height=\"472\" alt=\"월간 학습 플랜 예시\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.12s\" src=\"/img/coaching/plan-2.png\" width=\"710\" height=\"472\" alt=\"일간 학습 플랜 예시\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 이런 학생에게 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"c-sec c-who\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">학습코칭은 <em>이런 학생에게 필요</em>합니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"c-card anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/student-1.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>공부를 어디서부터<br />시작 해야 하는지 모르는</p><b>중학교 2학년 심*석</b></div>\n      <div class=\"c-card anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\" style=\"animation-delay:.12s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/student-2.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>열심히 플랜을 세우지만<br />실천하기 어려운</p><b>고등학교 1학년 김*예</b></div>\n      <div class=\"c-card anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\" style=\"animation-delay:.24s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/student-3.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>학원숙제하느라<br />나만의 공부시간이 없는</p><b>중학교 3학년 신*욱</b></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"types anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/types.png\" width=\"1248\" height=\"266\" alt=\"학습역량이 부족한 학생, 학습동기가 부족한 학생, 열심히 노력하지만 성적이 안나오는 학생을 위한 코칭 항목\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"c-video anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" id=\"coachVideo\">\n      <img src=\"/img/coaching/video-poster.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"레벨업 학습코칭 소개 영상\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"영상 재생\" data-yt=\"dm9KnAuYdSA\"><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 전문가 검증 · 후기 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"c-sec c-expert\" id=\"expert\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <img class=\"icon anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/coaching/expert-icon.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\"><em>진로 진학 전문가가 검증</em>한 코칭 수업</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">아이에게 맞춰진 최적의 코칭으로 습관을 레벨업 해드립니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"people\">\n      <div class=\"person anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/expert-1.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"160\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>전국입학담당관협의회 회장</p><b>정남환 교육학 박사</b></div>\n      <div class=\"person anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\" style=\"animation-delay:.12s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/expert-2.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"160\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>한국GFAT평가원장</p><b>김용 이학 박사</b></div>\n      <div class=\"person anim\" data-anim=\"flipInY\" style=\"animation-delay:.24s\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/expert-3.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"160\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>한국진로진학연구소 책임연구원</p><b>최인선 철학 박사</b></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"><img src=\"/img/coaching/divider.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"160\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">학생과 학부모가 <em>만족하는 수업 후기</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">성장과 만족이 담긴 생생한 리얼 후기로 증명합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"c-reviews\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/coaching/review-1.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"272\" alt=\"학습코칭 후기 1\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.08s\" src=\"/img/coaching/review-2.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"272\" alt=\"학습코칭 후기 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.16s\" src=\"/img/coaching/review-3.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"272\" alt=\"학습코칭 후기 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.24s\" src=\"/img/coaching/review-4.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"272\" alt=\"학습코칭 후기 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"학습코칭\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_coaching_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_coaching_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_coaching_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_coaching_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\" checked>학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_coaching_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_coaching_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_coaching_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_coaching_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_coaching_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_coaching_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>\n  // 유튜브 영상: 누르기 전에는 썸네일만 두고, 누르면 그때 불러온다 (페이지 속도)\n  document.querySelectorAll('.c-video button[data-yt]').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const box = b.parentElement;\n      const f = document.createElement('iframe');\n      f.src = 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/' + b.dataset.yt + '?autoplay=1&rel=0';\n      f.allow = 'accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture';\n      f.allowFullscreen = true; f.title = '레벨업 학습코칭 소개 영상';\n      box.innerHTML = ''; box.appendChild(f);\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-adult":{"title":"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 | 비즈니스 영어 1:1 화상 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 | 비즈니스 영어 1:1 화상 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"성인 영어회화, 직장인·비즈니스 영어를 1:1 화상으로. 초급 프리토킹부터 회의·이메일·프레젠테이션 영어까지 레벨 진단 후 내 목표에 맞춘 수업. 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-adult\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 | 비즈니스 영어 1:1 화상 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"성인 영어회화, 직장인·비즈니스 영어를 1:1 화상으로. 초급 프리토킹부터 회의·이메일·프레젠테이션 영어까지 레벨 진단 후 내 목표에 맞춘 수업. 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-adult\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 | 비즈니스 영어 1:1 화상 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"성인 영어회화, 직장인·비즈니스 영어를 1:1 화상으로. 초급 프리토킹부터 회의·이메일·프레젠테이션 영어까지 레벨 진단 후 내 목표에 맞춘 수업. 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-adult\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"완전 초보도 가능한가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 한국어가 가능한 국내 강사와 시작해 알파벳·기초 문장부터 잡고, 익숙해지면 원어민 수업으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"수업 시간은 어떻게 정하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"평일 이른 아침, 점심, 저녁 10시까지 가능합니다. 주 1~3회, 회당 30·40·50분 중 고릅니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"비즈니스 영어는 어떤 자료로 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"본인의 실제 업무 메일, 발표 자료, 회의 안건을 가져오시면 그걸로 연습합니다. 없으면 업종별 상황 자료를 제공합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"얼마나 하면 효과가 나나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"주 2회 기준 3개월이면 대부분 짧은 회의와 일상 대화가 편해집니다. 첫 달에 녹음을 남겨 비교해 드립니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외\", \"description\": \"성인 영어회화, 직장인·비즈니스 영어를 1:1 화상으로. 초급 프리토킹부터 회의·이메일·프레젠테이션 영어까지 레벨 진단 후 내 목표에 맞춘 수업. 30분 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Adult · Business Conversation</span>\n        <h1>성인·직장인 <em>영어회화 과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">퇴근 후 30분, 점심시간 40분. 바쁜 성인에게 맞는 시간에 선생님과 1:1로 말하는 화상 영어회화입니다. 초급은 입이 트이는 프리토킹부터, 직장인은 회의·이메일·프레젠테이션 같은 실제 업무 상황을 그대로 연습합니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"성인·직장인 영어회화 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어로 말할 기회가 없어 입이 굳은 분</b><p>단어는 아는데 문장이 안 나오는 분. 매 수업 말하는 시간을 70% 이상으로 잡아 실제로 입을 엽니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>업무에서 영어를 써야 하는 직장인</b><p>해외 거래처 메일, 화상회의, 영어 발표. 본인 업무 자료를 가져오면 그걸로 수업합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>해외 이직·주재원·이민을 준비하는 분</b><p>면접·일상 생활 영어를 기간 안에 끌어올리는 집중 플랜을 짭니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>레벨 진단</b><p>15분 대화로 발음·문장 구성·어휘 수준을 확인하고 목표(회화·비즈니스·시험)를 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>맞춤 커리큘럼</b><p>일상 회화, 비즈니스 상황, 발음 교정 중 필요한 것만 골라 4주 단위 계획을 세웁니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>줌으로 진행하며 선생님이 실시간으로 문장을 고쳐 줍니다. 수업 후 교정 노트를 받습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>월 피드백</b><p>한 달마다 녹음 비교와 평가로 늘어난 부분과 다음 달 과제를 정리합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>입문·초급</td><td>자기소개, 일상 대화 패턴 60개, 발음 기초</td><td>질문에 3문장으로 답하기</td></tr><tr><td>중급</td><td>의견 말하기, 상황별 표현, 뉴스·드라마 소재 토론</td><td>10분 이상 대화 이어가기</td></tr><tr><td>비즈니스</td><td>회의·전화·이메일·프레젠테이션 영어, 협상 표현</td><td>업무 상황을 영어로 처리하기</td></tr><tr><td>고급</td><td>프리토킹, 시사 토론, 정교한 표현과 뉘앙스</td><td>원어민과 자연스러운 대화</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>완전 초보도 가능한가요?</summary><p>네. 한국어가 가능한 국내 강사와 시작해 알파벳·기초 문장부터 잡고, 익숙해지면 원어민 수업으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>수업 시간은 어떻게 정하나요?</summary><p>평일 이른 아침, 점심, 저녁 10시까지 가능합니다. 주 1~3회, 회당 30·40·50분 중 고릅니다.</p></details><details><summary>비즈니스 영어는 어떤 자료로 하나요?</summary><p>본인의 실제 업무 메일, 발표 자료, 회의 안건을 가져오시면 그걸로 연습합니다. 없으면 업종별 상황 자료를 제공합니다.</p></details><details><summary>얼마나 하면 효과가 나나요?</summary><p>주 2회 기준 3개월이면 대부분 짧은 회의와 일상 대화가 편해집니다. 첫 달에 녹음을 남겨 비교해 드립니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"성인 영어회화\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishadult_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishadult_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishadult_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishadult_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishadult_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishadult_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishadult_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishadult_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishadult_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishadult_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-conversation":{"title":"파워 외국어 회화 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>파워 외국어 회화 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"지금이 바로 영어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 유·초등부터 성인·비즈니스 회화, 인증시험·인터뷰 대비까지 1:1 맞춤 솔루션. 200여 명의 검증된 프리미엄 강사진과 함께합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"파워 외국어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 영어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 유·초등부터 성인·비즈니스 회화, 인증시험·인터뷰 대비까지 1:1 맞춤 솔루션. 200여 명의 검증된 프리미엄 강사진과 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"파워 외국어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 영어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 유·초등부터 성인·비즈니스 회화, 인증시험·인터뷰 대비까지 1:1 맞춤 솔루션. 200여 명의 검증된 프리미엄 강사진과 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"외국어\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 파워 외국어 회화 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/lang/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3;--sky:#6AB9F7}\n  .l-kicker{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sky);letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .l-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .l-hero .txt{text-align:center;margin-top:60px}\n  .l-hero h1{font-size:60px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .l-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .l-hero .en{font-size:20px;color:#666;margin-top:18px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .4s both}\n  .l-hero .pics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:50px}\n  .l-hero .pics img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n\n  .l-sec{padding:120px 0}\n  .l-key .imgs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;margin-top:60px}\n  .l-key .imgs img{width:100%;height:auto}\n\n  .l-cur{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .l-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;margin-top:60px}\n  .l-card{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .l-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 30px 50px -26px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .l-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover}\n  .l-card .b{padding:28px 30px 32px}\n  .l-card .en{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue)}\n  .l-card h3{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin:4px 0 14px}\n  .l-card p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#666}\n  .l-cards .l-card:first-child{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .l-cards .l-card:first-child img{height:100%;aspect-ratio:auto}\n  .l-cards .l-card:first-child .b{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:40px}\n  .l-diverse{margin-top:120px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:380px 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:start}\n  .l-diverse .s-h2{font-size:48px}\n  .l-diverse .s-h2 .en{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sky);margin-bottom:8px}\n  .l-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}\n  .l-tiles img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -16px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .25s}\n  .l-tiles img:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .l-more{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px}\n  .l-more button,.l-more a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:46px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid var(--blue);background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n  .l-more button:hover,.l-more a:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n\n  .l-tutors{position:relative;background:#fff;overflow:hidden}\n  .l-tutors::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-120px;top:120px;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,170,200,.45),rgba(255,210,170,.25) 55%,transparent 72%);filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none}\n  .l-tutors::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-140px;bottom:80px;width:560px;height:560px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(180,170,255,.4),rgba(170,230,200,.25) 55%,transparent 72%);filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none}\n  .l-tutors .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .l-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:60px}\n  .l-grid img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transition:transform .3s}\n  .l-grid img:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}\n  .l-grid .hide{display:none}\n  .l-grid.open .hide{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n\n  .l-reviews{background:#E9F5FE;overflow:hidden}\n  .l-reviews .head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px}\n  .l-reviews .head img{width:110px;height:110px}\n  .l-rev{margin-top:60px}\n  .l-rev .marquee-track{gap:20px;animation-duration:40s}\n  .l-rev .item{width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .l-rev .item img{width:285px;height:507px;object-fit:cover}\n\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .l-hero h1{font-size:46px}\n    .l-diverse{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}\n    .l-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .l-kicker{font-size:15px}\n    .l-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .l-hero .txt{margin-top:34px}\n    .l-hero h1{font-size:28px}\n    .l-hero .en{font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}\n    .l-hero .pics{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}\n    .l-hero .pics img{border-radius:14px}\n    .l-sec{padding:70px 0}\n    .l-key .imgs{gap:14px;margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;margin-left:-20px;margin-right:-20px;padding:0 20px}\n    .l-key .imgs img{min-width:820px}\n    .l-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:34px}\n    .l-cards .l-card:first-child{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n    .l-cards .l-card:first-child img{aspect-ratio:16/9;height:auto}\n    .l-cards .l-card:first-child .b{padding:24px}\n    .l-card .b{padding:22px 22px 26px}\n    .l-card .en{font-size:16px}\n    .l-card h3{font-size:21px}\n    .l-card p{font-size:15px}\n    .l-diverse{margin-top:70px}\n    .l-diverse .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .l-diverse .s-h2 .en{font-size:15px}\n    .l-tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\n    .l-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}\n    .l-grid img{border-radius:14px}\n    .l-reviews .head{flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n    .l-reviews .head img{width:70px;height:70px}\n    .l-rev{margin-top:34px}\n    .l-rev .item{width:220px}\n    .l-rev .item img{width:220px;height:391px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 외국어 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"l-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"외국어\">\n      <a class=\"on\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"txt\">\n      <span class=\"l-kicker\">POWER 외국어 회화</span>\n      <h1>지금이 바로<br /><em>영어 실력 레벨업</em> 타이밍!</h1>\n      <p class=\"en\">Get ready to supercharge your English skills - it’s time to level up!</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pics\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeIn\" src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"헤드폰을 쓰고 영어 회화 수업을 듣는 학생\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.15s\" src=\"/img/lang/hero-2.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"노트북으로 화상 영어 수업을 듣는 학생\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── Lesson Key Point ───────── -->\n<section class=\"l-sec l-key\" id=\"keypoint\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">Lesson Key Point</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">1:1 맞춤 솔루션으로<br />영어 실력, <em>빠르게 레벨업!</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"imgs\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/lang/keypoint-1.png\" width=\"1472\" height=\"250\" alt=\"01 200여 명의 전문 강사진: 영어, 한국어 모두 가능한 국내 Bilingual 강사진으로 원활한 소통과 피드백. 02 최적의 학습 경험 제공: 학생의 수준과 목표에 딱 맞춘 맞춤형 수업 설계, 성향·목표에 따라 개별 진도와 자료를 구성. 03 교육과정을 반영한 수업: 수행평가, 모의고사 듣기 등 내신부터 수능까지 전략적인 대비로 성적 관리 가능\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.15s\" src=\"/img/lang/keypoint-2.png\" width=\"1472\" height=\"250\" alt=\"04 커스텀 가능한 수업: 1:1 맞춤 커리큘럼 제공, 20년 이상 축적된 경험과 노하우, 다양하고 차별화된 콘텐츠. 05 밀착 회원 관리: 강사진&컨설턴트와의 상담, 월평가를 통한 지속적인 학습 관리. 06 최고의 강사진: 학력&실력이 검증된 전문 강사진, 시스템을 통한 강사 관리, 정기적인 교수법 연구와 교육이수\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 커리큘럼 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"l-sec l-cur\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">Flexible Curriculum</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">자유로운 커리큘럼</h2>\n    <div class=\"l-cards\">\n      <article class=\"l-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/lang/cur-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"성인 회화 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"b\"><span class=\"en\">Adult Conversation</span><h3>성인 회화</h3><p>초급부터 고급 비지니스 회화까지<br />회원 레벨과 학습 목표에 맞춰 진행되는 수업</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"l-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/lang/cur-2.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"중·고등 회화 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"b\"><span class=\"en\">Teen Conversation</span><h3>중·고등 회화</h3><p>교과서 활용, 다양한 주제의 대화로<br />듣기평가 및 내신 완벽대비</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"l-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/lang/cur-3.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"유·초등 회화 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"b\"><span class=\"en\">Kids Conversation</span><h3>유·초등 회화</h3><p>말하기, 듣기, 쓰기, 읽기 4가지 영역<br />균형잡힌 수업으로 말문을 열어주는 학습단계</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"l-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/lang/cur-4.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"인증시험 대비 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"b\"><span class=\"en\">Test Preparation</span><h3>인증시험 대비</h3><p>TOEIC, TOFLE, IELTS, OPIC 등<br />수준별 영어 인증시험 대비 수업</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"l-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/lang/cur-5.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"인터뷰 대비 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"b\"><span class=\"en\">Interview Preparation</span><h3>인터뷰 대비</h3><p>국제학교, 대학 면접 및 승무원 입사 관련 등을<br />위한 맞춤 학습과 실전 대비 훈련</p></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"l-diverse\">\n      <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\"><span class=\"en\">Diverse Curriculum</span>레벨업 과외만의<br /><em>다양한 커리큘럼</em></h2>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"l-tiles\" id=\"tiles\">\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-1.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"파닉스 과정: 정확한 발음과 단어, 문장을 익힘으로써 영어의 완벽한 첫 걸음을 위한 과정\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-2.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-3.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-4.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-5.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 5\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-6.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 6\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-7.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 7\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-8.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 8\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-9.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 9\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/lang/tile-10.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"커리큘럼 10\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"l-more\"><a href=\"#contact\">더보기</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── Premium Tutors ───────── -->\n<section class=\"l-sec l-tutors\" id=\"tutors\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">Premium Tutors</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">엄격하게 검증된 <em>프리미엄 강사진!</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"l-grid\" id=\"tutorGrid\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 1\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.06s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.12s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.18s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-5.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 5\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.06s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-6.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 6\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.12s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-7.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 7\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.18s\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-8.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 8\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-9.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 9\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-10.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 10\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-11.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 11\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-12.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 12\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-13.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 13\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"hide\" src=\"/img/lang/tutor-14.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"강사 소개 14\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l-more\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"tutorMore\">더보기</button></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 수업 후기 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"l-sec l-reviews\" id=\"reviews\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head anim\" data-anim=\"fadeIn\">\n      <img src=\"/img/lang/icon-doc.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div><span class=\"l-kicker\" style=\"text-align:left\">Real People. Real Experiences.</span><h2 class=\"s-h2\">실제 회원들의 <em>100% 리얼 수업 후기!</em></h2></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"marquee l-rev\" aria-label=\"수업 후기 슬라이드\">\n    <div class=\"marquee-track\" data-marquee>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-1.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 1\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-2.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 2\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-3.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 3\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-4.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 4\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-5.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 5\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/lang/review-6.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"507\" alt=\"수업 후기 6\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 관련 수업 (키워드 페이지) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-alt\" id=\"related\"><div class=\"rel-box\" style=\"padding-top:70px\"><h2 class=\"s-h2\">목적별 <em>영어 수업</em> 바로가기</h2><div class=\"kw-rel\"><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"외국어 회화\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishconversation_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishconversation_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishconversation_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishconversation_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishconversation_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishconversation_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishconversation_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishconversation_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishconversation_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishconversation_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>\n  // 강사진 더보기\n  const tm = document.getElementById('tutorMore');\n  if (tm) tm.addEventListener('click', () => { document.getElementById('tutorGrid').classList.add('open'); tm.parentElement.style.display = 'none'; });\n  // 후기 무한 슬라이드 (홈과 같은 방식: 카드를 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게)\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-marquee]').forEach((t) => { t.innerHTML += t.innerHTML; });\n</script>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-ielts-toefl":{"title":"아이엘츠·토플 과외 | IELTS·TOEFL 1:1 스피킹·라이팅 대비 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>아이엘츠·토플 과외 | IELTS·TOEFL 1:1 스피킹·라이팅 대비 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"아이엘츠 6.5~7.5, 토플 90~110 목표 1:1 과외. 스피킹·라이팅 첨삭 중심으로 유학·이민·대학원 기한에 맞춘 집중 과정. 채점 기준 기반 피드백, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-ielts-toefl\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"아이엘츠·토플 과외 | IELTS·TOEFL 1:1 스피킹·라이팅 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"아이엘츠 6.5~7.5, 토플 90~110 목표 1:1 과외. 스피킹·라이팅 첨삭 중심으로 유학·이민·대학원 기한에 맞춘 집중 과정. 채점 기준 기반 피드백, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-ielts-toefl\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"아이엘츠·토플 과외 | IELTS·TOEFL 1:1 스피킹·라이팅 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"아이엘츠 6.5~7.5, 토플 90~110 목표 1:1 과외. 스피킹·라이팅 첨삭 중심으로 유학·이민·대학원 기한에 맞춘 집중 과정. 채점 기준 기반 피드백, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"아이엘츠·토플 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-ielts-toefl\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"아이엘츠와 토플 중 어느 쪽이 쉬운가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"말하기를 사람과 하는 게 편하면 아이엘츠, 컴퓨터로 통합형 문제가 편하면 토플이 맞습니다. 지원 학교가 받는 시험을 먼저 확인하세요.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"첨삭은 얼마나 자세히 해주나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"문장 단위로 문법·어휘·논리를 표시하고, 채점 기준 항목별 예상 점수와 고친 예시 답안을 드립니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"얼마나 걸리나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"5.5→6.5는 보통 8~12주, 6.5→7.0은 6~8주 정도 잡습니다. 진단 후 기간을 정합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"원어민 선생님 수업인가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"스피킹·라이팅은 시험 채점 경험이 있는 원어민 또는 이중언어 선생님이, 전략 수업은 한국인 선생님이 맡습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"아이엘츠·토플 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"아이엘츠·토플 과외\", \"description\": \"아이엘츠 6.5~7.5, 토플 90~110 목표 1:1 과외. 스피킹·라이팅 첨삭 중심으로 유학·이민·대학원 기한에 맞춘 집중 과정. 채점 기준 기반 피드백, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 아이엘츠·토플 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>아이엘츠·토플 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">IELTS · TOEFL</span>\n        <h1>아이엘츠·토플 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">아이엘츠와 토플은 스피킹·라이팅에서 점수가 갈립니다. 혼자서는 채점 기준에 맞는 답인지 알 수 없어서 정체되기 쉽습니다. 1:1로 매 수업 에세이와 스피킹 답변을 채점 기준(Band Descriptor·Rubric)에 대입해 고치고, 리스닝·리딩은 유형별 시간 전략으로 잡습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"아이엘츠·토플 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>유학·교환학생 지원 점수가 필요한 학생</b><p>학교별 요구 점수와 마감일을 기준으로 주간 계획을 세웁니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>이민·취업 비자용 아이엘츠가 필요한 분</b><p>General 모듈 특성에 맞춰 편지 쓰기·실용 리스닝을 집중 연습합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>스피킹·라이팅에서 6.0을 못 넘는 분</b><p>문법 실수보다 구조와 논리 전개가 문제인 경우가 많습니다. 첨삭으로 바로 보여 드립니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>모의 진단</b><p>4개 영역 축약 모의고사로 현재 점수대와 약한 영역을 확인합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>영역별 전략</b><p>리스닝·리딩은 유형별 시간 배분, 스피킹·라이팅은 답변 구조와 어휘 확장.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>첨삭 수업</b><p>라이팅 Task 1·2 매주 2편 첨삭, 스피킹 파트 1~3 녹음 교정.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>풀모의고사</b><p>시험 2주 전부터 실제 시간으로 풀세트를 풀고 점수 추이를 관리합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>기초 다지기</td><td>시험 구조, 아카데믹 어휘 600, 문단 쓰기 기본</td><td>각 영역 5.5 이상</td></tr><tr><td>영역별 훈련</td><td>유형별 리스닝·리딩, 에세이 구조(찬반·원인·해결), 스피킹 파트별 답변</td><td>6.0~6.5</td></tr><tr><td>심화</td><td>복합 문장·고급 어휘, 그래프 묘사, 파트 3 추상 질문</td><td>7.0</td></tr><tr><td>실전</td><td>풀모의고사, 시간 관리, 약점 영역 집중</td><td>목표 점수 안정화</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>아이엘츠와 토플 중 어느 쪽이 쉬운가요?</summary><p>말하기를 사람과 하는 게 편하면 아이엘츠, 컴퓨터로 통합형 문제가 편하면 토플이 맞습니다. 지원 학교가 받는 시험을 먼저 확인하세요.</p></details><details><summary>첨삭은 얼마나 자세히 해주나요?</summary><p>문장 단위로 문법·어휘·논리를 표시하고, 채점 기준 항목별 예상 점수와 고친 예시 답안을 드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>얼마나 걸리나요?</summary><p>5.5→6.5는 보통 8~12주, 6.5→7.0은 6~8주 정도 잡습니다. 진단 후 기간을 정합니다.</p></details><details><summary>원어민 선생님 수업인가요?</summary><p>스피킹·라이팅은 시험 채점 경험이 있는 원어민 또는 이중언어 선생님이, 전략 수업은 한국인 선생님이 맡습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"아이엘츠·토플\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishieltstoefl_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishieltstoefl_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishieltstoefl_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishieltstoefl_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishieltstoefl_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishieltstoefl_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishieltstoefl_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishieltstoefl_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishieltstoefl_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishieltstoefl_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-interview":{"title":"영어 면접 과외 | 승무원·국제학교·대학 인터뷰 1:1 대비 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>영어 면접 과외 | 승무원·국제학교·대학 인터뷰 1:1 대비 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"영어 면접 1:1 과외. 승무원 채용, 국제학교·외고 입학, 대학·대학원 영어 인터뷰, 외국계 기업 면접까지 예상 질문 답변 설계와 모의 면접 녹화 피드백. 단기 집중 가능.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-interview\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"영어 면접 과외 | 승무원·국제학교·대학 인터뷰 1:1 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"영어 면접 1:1 과외. 승무원 채용, 국제학교·외고 입학, 대학·대학원 영어 인터뷰, 외국계 기업 면접까지 예상 질문 답변 설계와 모의 면접 녹화 피드백. 단기 집중 가능.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-interview\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"영어 면접 과외 | 승무원·국제학교·대학 인터뷰 1:1 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"영어 면접 1:1 과외. 승무원 채용, 국제학교·외고 입학, 대학·대학원 영어 인터뷰, 외국계 기업 면접까지 예상 질문 답변 설계와 모의 면접 녹화 피드백. 단기 집중 가능.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"영어 면접 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-interview\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"영어가 부족한데 면접까지 2주 남았어요.\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"가능합니다. 답변 30개를 먼저 완성하고 매일 녹음 과제로 입에 붙입니다. 2주 집중은 주 4~5회로 진행합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"승무원 면접 경험이 있는 선생님인가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 항공사 근무·면접 경험이 있는 선생님이 승무원 준비생을 맡습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"아이 국제학교 인터뷰도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"초등 저학년부터 가능합니다. 부모 인터뷰가 있는 학교는 부모님 답변도 함께 준비해 드립니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"녹화 피드백은 어떻게 받나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"수업 중 녹화한 영상과 선생님 코멘트를 수업 후 전달합니다. 본인이 보면서 고치는 게 가장 빠릅니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"영어 면접 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"영어 면접 과외\", \"description\": \"영어 면접 1:1 과외. 승무원 채용, 국제학교·외고 입학, 대학·대학원 영어 인터뷰, 외국계 기업 면접까지 예상 질문 답변 설계와 모의 면접 녹화 피드백. 단기 집중 가능.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 영어 면접 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>영어 면접 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Interview Preparation</span>\n        <h1>영어 면접 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">영어 면접은 영어 실력 시험이 아니라 &#x27;나를 설명하는 자리&#x27;입니다. 예상 질문 30개에 대한 나만의 답변을 함께 만들고, 실제 면접처럼 녹화해 표정·속도·눈맞춤까지 고칩니다. 승무원, 국제학교, 대학·대학원, 외국계 기업 면접 경험이 있는 선생님이 맡습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"영어 면접 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>항공사 승무원 채용을 준비하는 분</b><p>서비스 상황 질문, 영어 방송문, 그룹 토론까지 항공사별 유형에 맞춰 준비합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>국제학교·외고·자사고 영어 인터뷰를 앞둔 학생</b><p>자기소개, 지원 동기, 즉석 질문 대응을 나이에 맞는 표현으로 연습합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>외국계 기업·대학원 영어 면접이 있는 분</b><p>경력·연구 소개, 상황 질문(STAR), 역질문까지 실제 순서로 리허설합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>면접 분석</b><p>지원처의 면접 형식, 기출 질문, 평가 포인트를 정리합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>답변 설계</b><p>자기소개·지원 동기·강점·경험 질문 30개의 답변을 본인 이야기로 씁니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>모의 면접</b><p>녹화 후 내용·발음·태도를 함께 보고 수정합니다. 예상 못 한 질문 대응도 연습합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>최종 리허설</b><p>면접 2~3일 전 실제 복장·시간으로 마지막 리허설을 합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1주</td><td>자기소개 3버전(30초·1분·2분), 기본 질문 10개</td><td>막힘 없이 자기소개</td></tr><tr><td>2주</td><td>경험·강점 질문(STAR 구조), 지원 동기, 역질문</td><td>근거 있는 답변</td></tr><tr><td>3주</td><td>상황·돌발 질문, 그룹 토론·롤플레이</td><td>즉석 대응</td></tr><tr><td>면접 직전</td><td>풀 모의 면접 2회, 표정·속도 교정</td><td>실제 면접 그대로</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>영어가 부족한데 면접까지 2주 남았어요.</summary><p>가능합니다. 답변 30개를 먼저 완성하고 매일 녹음 과제로 입에 붙입니다. 2주 집중은 주 4~5회로 진행합니다.</p></details><details><summary>승무원 면접 경험이 있는 선생님인가요?</summary><p>네. 항공사 근무·면접 경험이 있는 선생님이 승무원 준비생을 맡습니다.</p></details><details><summary>아이 국제학교 인터뷰도 되나요?</summary><p>초등 저학년부터 가능합니다. 부모 인터뷰가 있는 학교는 부모님 답변도 함께 준비해 드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>녹화 피드백은 어떻게 받나요?</summary><p>수업 중 녹화한 영상과 선생님 코멘트를 수업 후 전달합니다. 본인이 보면서 고치는 게 가장 빠릅니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"영어 면접\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishinterview_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishinterview_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishinterview_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishinterview_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishinterview_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishinterview_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishinterview_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishinterview_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishinterview_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishinterview_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-kids":{"title":"유아·초등 영어회화 과외 | 어린이 화상영어 1:1 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>유아·초등 영어회화 과외 | 어린이 화상영어 1:1 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 화상영어 1:1 과외. 말하기·듣기·읽기·쓰기 4영역을 놀이와 그림책으로 균형 있게. 파닉스부터 문장 말하기까지 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-kids\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"유아·초등 영어회화 과외 | 어린이 화상영어 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 화상영어 1:1 과외. 말하기·듣기·읽기·쓰기 4영역을 놀이와 그림책으로 균형 있게. 파닉스부터 문장 말하기까지 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-kids\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"유아·초등 영어회화 과외 | 어린이 화상영어 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"유아·초등 어린이 화상영어 1:1 과외. 말하기·듣기·읽기·쓰기 4영역을 놀이와 그림책으로 균형 있게. 파닉스부터 문장 말하기까지 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"유아·초등 영어회화 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-kids\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"몇 살부터 가능한가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"5세부터 가능합니다. 집중 시간이 짧은 유아는 25분 수업으로 시작합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"원어민 선생님인가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"처음에는 한국어로 안내가 가능한 이중언어 선생님을 권합니다. 아이가 익숙해지면 원어민 선생님으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"준비물이 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"태블릿이나 컴퓨터, 그리고 아이가 그릴 종이와 색연필이면 됩니다. 교재는 수업에 맞춰 안내드립니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"형제가 같이 들을 수 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"가능하지만 1:1 효과를 위해 각각 수업을 권합니다. 형제 동시 등록 시 상담에서 안내드립니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"유아·초등 영어회화 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"유아·초등 영어회화 과외\", \"description\": \"유아·초등 어린이 화상영어 1:1 과외. 말하기·듣기·읽기·쓰기 4영역을 놀이와 그림책으로 균형 있게. 파닉스부터 문장 말하기까지 아이 성향에 맞춘 수업, 30분 무료 체험.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 유아·초등 영어회화 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>유아·초등 영어회화 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Kids Conversation</span>\n        <h1>유아·초등 <em>영어회화 과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">아이가 영어를 &#x27;공부&#x27;가 아니라 &#x27;대화&#x27;로 만나게 합니다. 그림책, 노래, 역할놀이로 시작해 듣고 따라 말하는 시간을 충분히 주고, 초등 고학년은 읽기·쓰기까지 4영역을 균형 있게 키웁니다. 선생님 한 명이 아이 한 명을 끝까지 봅니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"유아·초등 영어회화 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어를 처음 시작하는 5~8세</b><p>소리와 그림으로 영어에 익숙해지는 단계. 파닉스와 짧은 말 주고받기부터 합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>학원에 다니지만 말은 못 하는 초등학생</b><p>단어 시험은 잘 보는데 대화가 안 되는 아이. 1:1이라 말할 기회가 수업 내내 있습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어 유치원·국제학교를 준비하는 아이</b><p>인터뷰와 수업 참여에 필요한 표현을 놀이처럼 연습합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>성향·레벨 확인</b><p>아이가 좋아하는 것(공룡, 그림 그리기, 게임)을 먼저 듣고, 20분 놀이 수업으로 수준을 봅니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>교재·주제 선택</b><p>그림책, 파닉스 워크북, 아이 관심사 주제를 섞어 4주 계획을 짭니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>25~40분, 화면에 그림을 띄우고 말하기 중심으로 진행합니다. 부모님은 옆에서 지켜봐도 됩니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>부모 리포트</b><p>수업 후 오늘 배운 표현과 집에서 3분만 해볼 활동을 문자로 보내드립니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Step 1</td><td>알파벳·파닉스, 인사와 간단한 대답</td><td>단어를 듣고 소리 내어 읽기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 2</td><td>그림책 읽기, 일상 표현, 짧은 질문·대답</td><td>3~4단어 문장으로 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 3</td><td>이야기 다시 말하기, 일기 쓰기, 발표</td><td>한 가지 주제로 5문장 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>Step 4</td><td>챕터북 읽기, 토론 놀이, 에세이 기초</td><td>자기 생각을 영어로 설명하기</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>몇 살부터 가능한가요?</summary><p>5세부터 가능합니다. 집중 시간이 짧은 유아는 25분 수업으로 시작합니다.</p></details><details><summary>원어민 선생님인가요?</summary><p>처음에는 한국어로 안내가 가능한 이중언어 선생님을 권합니다. 아이가 익숙해지면 원어민 선생님으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>준비물이 있나요?</summary><p>태블릿이나 컴퓨터, 그리고 아이가 그릴 종이와 색연필이면 됩니다. 교재는 수업에 맞춰 안내드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>형제가 같이 들을 수 있나요?</summary><p>가능하지만 1:1 효과를 위해 각각 수업을 권합니다. 형제 동시 등록 시 상담에서 안내드립니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"유·초등 영어회화\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishkids_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishkids_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishkids_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishkids_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishkids_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishkids_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishkids_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishkids_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishkids_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishkids_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-phonics":{"title":"파닉스 과외 | 영어 첫걸음 1:1 화상 수업 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>파닉스 과외 | 영어 첫걸음 1:1 화상 수업 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"파닉스 1:1 화상 과외. 알파벳 소리부터 단모음·장모음·이중자음, 사이트워드까지 아이가 스스로 영어를 읽게 하는 첫 단계. 그림책·노래로 재미있게, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-phonics\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"파닉스 과외 | 영어 첫걸음 1:1 화상 수업 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"파닉스 1:1 화상 과외. 알파벳 소리부터 단모음·장모음·이중자음, 사이트워드까지 아이가 스스로 영어를 읽게 하는 첫 단계. 그림책·노래로 재미있게, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-phonics\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"파닉스 과외 | 영어 첫걸음 1:1 화상 수업 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"파닉스 1:1 화상 과외. 알파벳 소리부터 단모음·장모음·이중자음, 사이트워드까지 아이가 스스로 영어를 읽게 하는 첫 단계. 그림책·노래로 재미있게, 30분 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"파닉스 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-phonics\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"파닉스는 몇 달 걸리나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"주 2회 기준 4~6개월이면 4단계까지 마치는 아이가 많습니다. 아이마다 다르니 진단 후 안내드립니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"한국인 선생님인가요, 원어민인가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"소리 규칙 설명이 필요한 단계라 한국어로 설명 가능한 이중언어 선생님을 권합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"집에서 뭘 도와주면 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"수업 후 보내드리는 단어 카드로 하루 3분 소리 내어 읽기만 해주시면 됩니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"파닉스 끝나면 뭘 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"리더스북 읽기와 유·초등 영어회화로 이어집니다. 같은 선생님이 계속 맡습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"파닉스 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"파닉스 과외\", \"description\": \"파닉스 1:1 화상 과외. 알파벳 소리부터 단모음·장모음·이중자음, 사이트워드까지 아이가 스스로 영어를 읽게 하는 첫 단계. 그림책·노래로 재미있게, 30분 무료 체험.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 파닉스 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>파닉스 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Phonics</span>\n        <h1>파닉스 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">파닉스는 영어를 &#x27;읽는 규칙&#x27;을 배우는 단계입니다. 알파벳 26개 소리를 정확히 익히고, 단모음·장모음·이중자음 규칙으로 처음 보는 단어도 읽게 합니다. 여기에 규칙에 안 맞는 사이트워드 100개를 더하면 그림책을 혼자 읽기 시작합니다. 1:1이라 아이 속도에 맞춰 넘어갑니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"파닉스 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어를 처음 시작하는 5~7세</b><p>소리 놀이와 노래로 알파벳 소리를 익히는 단계부터 시작합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어 학원에 다니는데 읽기가 안 되는 초등 저학년</b><p>통글자로 외운 아이는 새 단어를 못 읽습니다. 규칙부터 다시 잡습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어책 읽기로 넘어가고 싶은 아이</b><p>사이트워드와 파닉스를 마치고 리더스북 단계로 연결합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>소리 확인</b><p>알파벳 소리를 얼마나 아는지, 단어를 소리 내어 읽을 수 있는지 15분 놀이로 봅니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>단계 배정</b><p>알파벳 소리 → 단모음 → 장모음 → 이중자음·이중모음 → 사이트워드 5단계 중 시작점을 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>25~30분, 화면 카드와 그림책으로 소리 내어 읽기 중심. 매 수업 새 단어 10개를 스스로 읽습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>읽기 연결</b><p>파닉스가 끝나면 리더스북 1~2단계를 함께 읽으며 회화로 넘어갑니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1단계</td><td>알파벳 이름과 소리, 첫소리 구분</td><td>26개 소리 정확히 내기</td></tr><tr><td>2단계</td><td>단모음 a·e·i·o·u, CVC 단어(cat, pen)</td><td>3글자 단어 읽기</td></tr><tr><td>3단계</td><td>장모음(매직 e), 이중자음(sh, ch, th)</td><td>규칙으로 새 단어 읽기</td></tr><tr><td>4단계</td><td>이중모음(ai, ea, oo), 사이트워드 100</td><td>그림책 한 권 혼자 읽기</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>파닉스는 몇 달 걸리나요?</summary><p>주 2회 기준 4~6개월이면 4단계까지 마치는 아이가 많습니다. 아이마다 다르니 진단 후 안내드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>한국인 선생님인가요, 원어민인가요?</summary><p>소리 규칙 설명이 필요한 단계라 한국어로 설명 가능한 이중언어 선생님을 권합니다.</p></details><details><summary>집에서 뭘 도와주면 되나요?</summary><p>수업 후 보내드리는 단어 카드로 하루 3분 소리 내어 읽기만 해주시면 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>파닉스 끝나면 뭘 하나요?</summary><p>리더스북 읽기와 유·초등 영어회화로 이어집니다. 같은 선생님이 계속 맡습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"파닉스\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishphonics_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishphonics_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishphonics_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishphonics_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishphonics_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishphonics_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishphonics_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishphonics_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishphonics_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishphonics_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-teen":{"title":"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 | 내신·듣기평가 대비 1:1 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 | 내신·듣기평가 대비 1:1 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"중·고등 영어회화 1:1 과외. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익혀 내신 서술형·수행평가·듣기평가까지 한 번에. 수능 듣기와 스피킹 수행평가 대비, 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-teen\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 | 내신·듣기평가 대비 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"중·고등 영어회화 1:1 과외. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익혀 내신 서술형·수행평가·듣기평가까지 한 번에. 수능 듣기와 스피킹 수행평가 대비, 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-teen\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 | 내신·듣기평가 대비 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"중·고등 영어회화 1:1 과외. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익혀 내신 서술형·수행평가·듣기평가까지 한 번에. 수능 듣기와 스피킹 수행평가 대비, 30분 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-teen\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"회화 수업인데 내신에 도움이 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익히기 때문에 서술형 문장이 자연스럽게 외워지고, 듣기평가는 섀도잉으로 직접 점수가 오릅니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"학원과 병행해도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"학원에서 문법·독해를 하고 여기서 말하기·듣기를 보충하는 학생이 많습니다. 학원 진도에 맞춰 드립니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"방문 수업도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"지역에 따라 방문 수업이 가능하고, 화상 수업은 전국 어디서나 됩니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"수행평가 준비만 단기로 할 수 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"가능합니다. 발표·인터뷰 수행평가 2~4회 집중 수업으로 준비하는 학생도 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외\", \"description\": \"중·고등 영어회화 1:1 과외. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익혀 내신 서술형·수행평가·듣기평가까지 한 번에. 수능 듣기와 스피킹 수행평가 대비, 30분 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Teen Conversation</span>\n        <h1>중학생·고등학생 <em>영어회화 과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">중·고등학생의 영어회화는 성적과 따로 가지 않습니다. 교과서 본문과 단원 표현을 말하기로 익히면 서술형·수행평가·듣기평가가 같이 잡힙니다. 학교 진도에 맞춰 회화와 내신을 함께 대비하는 1:1 수업입니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>듣기평가에서 자꾸 틀리는 학생</b><p>들리는 만큼 말할 수 있습니다. 듣고 따라 말하는 섀도잉으로 듣기 점수를 올립니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>스피킹 수행평가가 부담스러운 학생</b><p>발표·역할극·인터뷰 수행평가를 실제처럼 연습하고 피드백을 받습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>영어는 잘하는데 말이 안 나오는 상위권</b><p>문법·독해는 되는데 회화가 약한 학생. 토론과 프리토킹으로 실전 감각을 만듭니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>학교 진도 확인</b><p>교과서·부교재·수행평가 일정을 받아 학기 단위 계획을 세웁니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>본문 말하기</b><p>단원 본문을 읽고 요약해 말하기. 서술형에 그대로 쓸 수 있는 문장을 입으로 익힙니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>듣기·발음</b><p>모의고사·수능 듣기 유형별 훈련과 발음 교정.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>시험 전 집중</b><p>내신 2주 전에는 서술형·듣기 대비 위주로 시간을 바꿔 운영합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>중1·2</td><td>교과서 표현 말하기, 기초 듣기, 자기소개·일상 대화</td><td>단원별 핵심 표현 암기 없이 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>중3</td><td>서술형 문장 훈련, 듣기평가 유형, 고등 대비 독해 말하기</td><td>내신 서술형 감점 줄이기</td></tr><tr><td>고1·2</td><td>수능 듣기 17문항 유형별 훈련, 수행평가 발표·토론</td><td>듣기 만점 · 수행 A</td></tr><tr><td>고3</td><td>수능 듣기 실전, 대입 면접 영어, 자기소개서 영어 문장</td><td>시험 당일 흔들리지 않는 듣기</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>회화 수업인데 내신에 도움이 되나요?</summary><p>네. 교과서 본문을 말하기로 익히기 때문에 서술형 문장이 자연스럽게 외워지고, 듣기평가는 섀도잉으로 직접 점수가 오릅니다.</p></details><details><summary>학원과 병행해도 되나요?</summary><p>학원에서 문법·독해를 하고 여기서 말하기·듣기를 보충하는 학생이 많습니다. 학원 진도에 맞춰 드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>방문 수업도 되나요?</summary><p>지역에 따라 방문 수업이 가능하고, 화상 수업은 전국 어디서나 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>수행평가 준비만 단기로 할 수 있나요?</summary><p>가능합니다. 발표·인터뷰 수행평가 2~4회 집중 수업으로 준비하는 학생도 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-toeic-opic\">토익스피킹·오픽 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"중·고등 영어회화\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishteen_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishteen_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishteen_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishteen_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishteen_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishteen_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishteen_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishteen_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishteen_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishteen_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/english-toeic-opic":{"title":"토익스피킹·오픽 과외 | 1:1 화상 스피킹 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>토익스피킹·오픽 과외 | 1:1 화상 스피킹 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"토익스피킹 IH·AL, 오픽 IH·AL 목표 1:1 과외. 유형별 답변 템플릿과 실제 채점 기준으로 피드백, 모의고사 녹음 첨삭까지. 2~4주 단기 집중 가능, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-toeic-opic\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"토익스피킹·오픽 과외 | 1:1 화상 스피킹 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"토익스피킹 IH·AL, 오픽 IH·AL 목표 1:1 과외. 유형별 답변 템플릿과 실제 채점 기준으로 피드백, 모의고사 녹음 첨삭까지. 2~4주 단기 집중 가능, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-toeic-opic\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"토익스피킹·오픽 과외 | 1:1 화상 스피킹 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"토익스피킹 IH·AL, 오픽 IH·AL 목표 1:1 과외. 유형별 답변 템플릿과 실제 채점 기준으로 피드백, 모의고사 녹음 첨삭까지. 2~4주 단기 집중 가능, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"영어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"토익스피킹·오픽 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-toeic-opic\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"토스와 오픽 중 뭐가 유리한가요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"말하기 속도가 빠르고 정보 전달이 편하면 토스, 자기 이야기를 길게 하는 게 편하면 오픽이 유리합니다. 진단 수업에서 둘 다 해보고 정합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"2주 만에 등급이 오르나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"IM2→IH처럼 한 단계는 2~3주 집중으로 가능한 경우가 많습니다. 두 단계 이상은 4주 이상 권합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"교재는 무엇을 쓰나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"시중 교재 대신 최신 기출 주제로 만든 자체 답변 노트를 씁니다. 본인 이야기로 채운 스크립트를 함께 만듭니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"환급이나 응시료 지원이 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"응시료 지원은 없지만 목표 등급 달성 후 재수강 시 할인이 있습니다. 상담에서 안내드립니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"토익스피킹·오픽 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"토익스피킹·오픽 과외\", \"description\": \"토익스피킹 IH·AL, 오픽 IH·AL 목표 1:1 과외. 유형별 답변 템플릿과 실제 채점 기준으로 피드백, 모의고사 녹음 첨삭까지. 2~4주 단기 집중 가능, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 토익스피킹·오픽 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화</a> › <span>토익스피킹·오픽 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">TOEIC Speaking · OPIc</span>\n        <h1>토익스피킹·오픽 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">스피킹 시험은 &#x27;영어 실력&#x27;보다 &#x27;시험 방식&#x27;을 아는 사람이 점수를 받습니다. 유형별 답변 구조, 시간 배분, 채점자가 듣는 포인트를 1:1로 잡고, 매 수업 실제 시험처럼 녹음해 첨삭합니다. 취업·승진 기한에 맞춘 2~4주 집중 과정도 있습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/lang/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"토익스피킹·오픽 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>취업·인턴 지원 마감이 정해진 분</b><p>목표 등급과 시험일을 기준으로 역산해 주 3~5회 집중 계획을 짭니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>몇 번 봐도 IM에서 멈춘 분</b><p>답변 길이와 구조가 원인인 경우가 많습니다. 녹음을 듣고 어디서 감점되는지 짚어 드립니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>회사 승진 요건으로 점수가 필요한 직장인</b><p>퇴근 후 저녁·주말 수업으로 4~6주 안에 목표 등급을 노립니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>모의 진단</b><p>실제 문항으로 녹음해 현재 등급과 감점 요인을 확인합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>유형별 전략</b><p>토스 5개 파트, 오픽 콤보 세트별 답변 구조와 자주 나오는 주제 15개를 잡습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>실전 녹음·첨삭</b><p>매 수업 시간 재고 녹음 → 선생님이 문장 단위로 교정 → 다시 말하기.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>시험 직전 리허설</b><p>시험 3일 전 풀세트 모의고사 2회로 시간 감각을 맞춥니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1주</td><td>시험 구조, 자기소개(오픽 서베이) 설계, 기본 답변 템플릿</td><td>모든 문항에 답변 시작하기</td></tr><tr><td>2주</td><td>묘사·비교·경험 유형, 토스 파트 3·4 정보 전달</td><td>답변 시간 채우기</td></tr><tr><td>3주</td><td>롤플레이·문제 해결, 의견 말하기(파트 5·오픽 15번)</td><td>논리적으로 이유 2개 말하기</td></tr><tr><td>4주</td><td>풀세트 모의고사 3회, 약점 파트 반복</td><td>목표 등급 안정적으로 받기</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">검증된 영어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/english-conversation#teachers\">영어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-1.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-3.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/lang/tutor-4.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"713\" alt=\"영어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>토스와 오픽 중 뭐가 유리한가요?</summary><p>말하기 속도가 빠르고 정보 전달이 편하면 토스, 자기 이야기를 길게 하는 게 편하면 오픽이 유리합니다. 진단 수업에서 둘 다 해보고 정합니다.</p></details><details><summary>2주 만에 등급이 오르나요?</summary><p>IM2→IH처럼 한 단계는 2~3주 집중으로 가능한 경우가 많습니다. 두 단계 이상은 4주 이상 권합니다.</p></details><details><summary>교재는 무엇을 쓰나요?</summary><p>시중 교재 대신 최신 기출 주제로 만든 자체 답변 노트를 씁니다. 본인 이야기로 채운 스크립트를 함께 만듭니다.</p></details><details><summary>환급이나 응시료 지원이 있나요?</summary><p>응시료 지원은 없지만 목표 등급 달성 후 재수강 시 할인이 있습니다. 상담에서 안내드립니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>영어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/english-conversation\">영어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/english-adult\">성인·직장인 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-kids\">유아·초등 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-teen\">중학생·고등학생 영어회화 과외</a><a href=\"/english-ielts-toefl\">아이엘츠·토플 과외</a><a href=\"/english-interview\">영어 면접 과외</a><a href=\"/english-phonics\">파닉스 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"토익스피킹·오픽\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishtoeicopic_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_englishtoeicopic_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_englishtoeicopic_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_englishtoeicopic_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_englishtoeicopic_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_englishtoeicopic_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_englishtoeicopic_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_englishtoeicopic_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_englishtoeicopic_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_englishtoeicopic_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/geomjeong":{"title":"검정고시 합격 레벨업 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>검정고시 합격 레벨업 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"검정고시 집중 프로그램. 응시자격·응시과목·합격기준부터 기출 집중 훈련, 성취도 리포트, 합격 후 진학 컨설팅까지 1:1 맞춤 수업으로 함께합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"검정고시 합격 레벨업 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"검정고시 집중 프로그램. 응시자격·응시과목·합격기준부터 기출 집중 훈련, 성취도 리포트, 합격 후 진학 컨설팅까지 1:1 맞춤 수업으로 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"검정고시 합격 레벨업 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"검정고시 집중 프로그램. 응시자격·응시과목·합격기준부터 기출 집중 훈련, 성취도 리포트, 합격 후 진학 컨설팅까지 1:1 맞춤 수업으로 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"특별프로그램\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"검정고시\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 검정고시 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/ged/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n  .g-hero{position:relative;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#E9F5FE;padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .g-hero .pic{position:relative;margin-top:24px;aspect-ratio:2/1;max-height:760px}\n  .g-hero .pic img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 0}\n  .g-hero .pic .b{opacity:0;animation:gedFade 6s ease-in-out 2s infinite}\n  @keyframes gedFade{0%,10%{opacity:0}35%,65%{opacity:1}90%,100%{opacity:0}}\n  .g-hero .pic .m{display:none}\n  .g-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin:-60px auto 0;position:relative;z-index:2}\n  .g-cards img{width:100%;height:auto;filter:drop-shadow(0 16px 28px rgba(33,150,243,.18))}\n\n  .g-info{position:relative;padding:120px 0;background:#E9F5FE url(\"/img/ged/bg-gradient.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat}\n  .g-info .title{display:block;margin:0 auto;height:auto}\n  .g-info .title.t1{width:min(560px,80%)}\n  .g-info .title.t2{width:min(760px,90%)}\n  .g-grades{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;max-width:960px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .g-grades img{width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -24px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .g-subj{max-width:1000px;margin:50px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:40px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(33,150,243,.3)}\n  .g-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:28px}\n  .g-tabs button{height:44px;padding:0 26px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#EEF4F9;color:#555;font:inherit;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n  .g-tabs button.on{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .g-pane{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}\n  .g-pane.on{display:grid;animation:fadeIn .35s both}\n  .g-pane div{background:#F7FBFF;border:1px solid #DCEBF7;border-radius:18px;padding:24px;text-align:center}\n  .g-pane b{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:8px}\n  .g-pane p{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}\n  .g-two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:24px auto 0}\n  .g-box{background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:36px 40px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(33,150,243,.3)}\n  .g-box h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:18px;text-align:center}\n  .g-box ul li{position:relative;padding:8px 0 8px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-bottom:1px dashed #DCEBF7}\n  .g-box ul li:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n  .g-box ul li::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:17px;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}\n  .g-box ul li strong{color:var(--ink)}\n  .g-box dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:10px 14px;align-items:center}\n  .g-box dt{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--blue);border-radius:999px;text-align:center;padding:6px 8px}\n  .g-box dd{margin:0;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-2)}\n\n  .g-why{padding:120px 0;background:#fff}\n  .g-why .intro{font-size:20px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:30px}\n  .g-why .points{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:50px}\n  .g-why .pt{background:#E9F5FE;border-radius:20px;padding:30px 32px}\n  .g-why .pt b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}\n  .g-why .pt p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .g-why .pt p::before{content:\"→ \";color:var(--blue);font-weight:800}\n\n  .g-lesson{padding:120px 0;background:#F7F8F9}\n  .g-lesson .lead{font-size:28px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .g-lesson .pic{max-width:960px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .g-lesson .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .g-lesson .note{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:40px}\n\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .g-why .points{gap:16px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .g-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .g-hero .pic{margin-top:16px;aspect-ratio:1024/600}\n    .g-hero .pic .a,.g-hero .pic .b{display:none}\n    .g-hero .pic .m{display:block;opacity:1}\n    .g-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:-20px;max-width:360px}\n    .g-info{padding:70px 0}\n    .g-grades{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;max-width:320px;margin-top:30px}\n    .g-subj{padding:24px 16px;border-radius:20px;margin-top:30px}\n    .g-tabs button{height:38px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .g-pane{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}\n    .g-pane p{font-size:17px}\n    .g-two{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}\n    .g-box{padding:26px 20px;border-radius:20px}\n    .g-box h3{font-size:20px}\n    .g-box dl{grid-template-columns:96px 1fr}\n    .g-why{padding:70px 0}\n    .g-why .intro{font-size:16px;margin-top:20px}\n    .g-why .points{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}\n    .g-why .pt{padding:22px 20px}\n    .g-why .pt b{font-size:19px}\n    .g-lesson{padding:70px 0}\n    .g-lesson .lead{font-size:20px}\n    .g-lesson .pic{margin-top:30px}\n    .g-lesson .note{font-size:15px;margin-top:24px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 특별프로그램 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"g-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"특별프로그램\">\n      <a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pic\">\n    <img class=\"a\" src=\"/img/ged/hero-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"960\" alt=\"검정고시 집중 프로그램, 검정고시 합격 레벨업\" />\n    <img class=\"b\" src=\"/img/ged/hero-2.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"960\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n    <img class=\"m\" src=\"/img/ged/hero-m.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"600\" alt=\"검정고시 집중 프로그램, 검정고시 합격 레벨업\" />\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"g-cards\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/ged/card-1.png\" width=\"395\" height=\"190\" alt=\"공고일 2월·6월\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" src=\"/img/ged/card-2.png\" width=\"395\" height=\"190\" alt=\"시험 시기 4월·8월\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\" src=\"/img/ged/card-3.png\" width=\"395\" height=\"190\" alt=\"발표일 5월·8월말\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 응시자격 · 응시과목 & 기준 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"g-info\" id=\"info\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <img class=\"title t1 anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/ged/title-eligibility.png\" width=\"1143\" height=\"140\" alt=\"검정고시 응시자격\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    <div class=\"g-grades\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/ged/grade-1.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"639\" alt=\"초등 검정고시 응시 자격: 만 11세 이상, 검정고시 공고일 이전 정원외 관리 대상자. 응시 제한: 특수학교 포함 재학생 응시 불가\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" src=\"/img/ged/grade-2.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"639\" alt=\"중등 검정고시 응시 자격\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\" src=\"/img/ged/grade-3.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"639\" alt=\"고등 검정고시 응시 자격\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <img class=\"title t2 anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/ged/title-subjects.png\" width=\"1627\" height=\"140\" alt=\"검정고시 응시과목 & 기준\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"margin-top:100px\" />\n    <div class=\"g-subj anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <div class=\"g-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"on\" data-pane=\"e\">초등</button><button type=\"button\" data-pane=\"m\">중등</button><button type=\"button\" data-pane=\"h\">고등</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"g-pane on\" data-pane=\"e\"><div><b>필수과목</b><p>국어 · 수학 · 사회 · 과학</p></div><div><b>선택과목 2과목 선택</b><p>도덕 · 체육 · 미술 · 실과 · 영어</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"g-pane\" data-pane=\"m\"><div><b>필수과목</b><p>국어 · 수학 · 사회 · 과학</p></div><div><b>선택과목 1과목 선택</b><p>도덕 · 기술&amp;가정 · 체육 · 음악 · 미술 · 정보</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"g-pane\" data-pane=\"h\"><div><b>필수과목</b><p>국어 · 수학 · 영어 · 사회 · 과학 · 한국사</p></div><div><b>선택과목 1과목 선택</b><p>도덕 · 기술&amp;가정 · 체육 · 음악 · 미술</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"g-two\">\n      <div class=\"g-box anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <h3>합격기준</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>각 과목은 <strong>100점 만점</strong>으로 진행</li>\n          <li>전 과목 <strong>평균 60점 이상</strong>이면 합격</li>\n          <li>평균이 60점 이상이어도 <strong>미응시 과목</strong>이 있으면 불합격</li>\n          <li>60점 미만 과목은 <strong>재응시 가능</strong>, 합격 과목은 <strong>면제 가능</strong></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"g-box anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">\n        <h3>대학진학법</h3>\n        <dl>\n          <dt>수시</dt><dd>논술, 예체능 필기시험 응시</dd>\n          <dt>정시</dt><dd>수능</dd>\n          <dt>학생부 전형</dt><dd>시험점수로 대체</dd>\n          <dt>교과면접</dt><dd>교과 성취도 기반 면접 평가</dd>\n          <dt>학생부 우수</dt><dd>학생부 종합 성취도 우수자</dd>\n          <dt>교과성적 우수</dt><dd>교과 성적 중심 선발</dd>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 왜 레벨업 과외로? ───────── -->\n<section class=\"g-why\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">왜 검정고시 준비는<br /><em>레벨업 과외</em>로 해야 하나요?</h2>\n    <p class=\"intro center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">검정고시는 일반 학교 시험과는 조금 다릅니다.<br />학교에서의 내신처럼 선생님의 지도가 있는 것도 아니고,<br />진도표나 학습 플랜이 정해져 있지 않아<br />처음 시작할 땐 막막함부터 느껴지는 경우가 많습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"points\">\n      <div class=\"pt anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><b>교과서 기반이지만 출제 범위는 광범위</b><p>어떤 내용을 중심으로 공부해야 할지 혼자서는 방향 잡기 어렵습니다.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"pt anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\"><b>성취도보다 ‘절대평가’</b><p>60점을 넘기기 위한 전략적 접근이 필요합니다.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"pt anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\"><b>교과서+기출+교육과정 이해가 필수</b><p>단순한 암기식 공부로는 점수를 확보하기 어렵습니다.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"pt anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.3s\"><b>검정고시 이후가 더 중요</b><p>대학 진학, 자격시험, 취업 준비 등 후속 단계까지 연결된 학습 설계가 필요합니다.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 레벨업 검정고시 수업 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"g-lesson\" id=\"lesson\">\n  <div class=\"wrap center\">\n    <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">레벨업 과외는 학생 한 명, 한 명에 꼭 맞춘 1:1 맞춤 수업으로<br />검정고시 준비의 방향부터 동기부여, 진로설계까지 함께합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/ged/program.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"931\" alt=\"레벨업 검정고시 수업: 기출 & 예상문제 집중 훈련, 매 단원 성취도 테스트 + 성적 리포트, 1:1 맞춤 학습, 멘탈 관리 수업, 합격 후 진학 컨설팅 연계\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    <p class=\"note anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">학생마다 공백 기간, 학습 수준, 목표가 모두 다르기 때문에<br />정형화된 인강이나 단체 강의로는 한계가 있습니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"검정고시\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_geomjeong_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_geomjeong_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_geomjeong_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_geomjeong_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_geomjeong_grade\">학생 학년</label><select id=\"f_geomjeong_grade\" name=\"grade\"><option value=\"\">선택해주세요</option><optgroup label=\"초등\"><option>초1</option><option>초2</option><option>초3</option><option>초4</option><option>초5</option><option>초6</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"중등\"><option>중1</option><option>중2</option><option>중3</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"고등\"><option>고1</option><option>고2</option><option>고3</option><option>재수·N수</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"기타\"><option>성인</option></optgroup></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\" checked>검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_geomjeong_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_geomjeong_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_geomjeong_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_geomjeong_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_geomjeong_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_geomjeong_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>\n  // 초등·중등·고등 과목 탭\n  document.querySelectorAll('.g-tabs button').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.g-tabs button').forEach((x) => x.classList.toggle('on', x === b));\n      document.querySelectorAll('.g-pane').forEach((p) => p.classList.toggle('on', p.dataset.pane === b.dataset.pane));\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/hangeul":{"title":"한글수업 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>한글수업 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"오늘부터 한글 레벨업! 통글자가 아닌 자음·모음 조합부터 차근차근 배우는 흥미 위주의 1:1 화상 한글 수업. 초등 입학 전 읽고 쓰기를 준비합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/hangeul\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"한글수업 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"오늘부터 한글 레벨업! 통글자가 아닌 자음·모음 조합부터 차근차근 배우는 흥미 위주의 1:1 화상 한글 수업. 초등 입학 전 읽고 쓰기를 준비합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/hangeul\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"한글수업 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"오늘부터 한글 레벨업! 통글자가 아닌 자음·모음 조합부터 차근차근 배우는 흥미 위주의 1:1 화상 한글 수업. 초등 입학 전 읽고 쓰기를 준비합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"특별프로그램\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"한글수업\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/hangeul\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 한글수업 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/hangeul/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n  .h-hero{position:relative;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff;padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .h-hero .pic{position:relative;margin-top:-40px;aspect-ratio:2/1;max-height:760px}\n  .h-hero .pic img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 100%;display:block}\n  .h-hero .pic .m{display:none}\n  .h-hero .txt{position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;padding-top:90px}\n  .h-hero .txt .kicker{display:none}\n  .h-hero h1{font-size:60px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .h-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .h-hero p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink);margin-top:22px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .4s both}\n\n  .h-body{background:#E9F5FE;padding:100px 0}\n  .h-body .blk{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}\n  .h-body .blk + .blk{margin-top:100px}\n  .h-body .blk img.full{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n  .h-body .lead{text-align:center;font-size:24px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .h-slides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .h-slides img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -24px rgba(33,150,243,.4);transition:transform .3s}\n  .h-slides img:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}\n  .h-more{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px}\n  .h-more a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid var(--blue);color:var(--blue);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n  .h-more a:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .h-prep{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:40px}\n  .h-prep img{width:100%;height:auto}\n  .h-body .how{border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(33,150,243,.4);margin-top:40px}\n\n  .h-next{padding:100px 0}\n  .h-next .lead{text-align:center;font-size:30px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:40px}\n  .h-next .lead em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .h-next a{display:block;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .3s}\n  .h-next a:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}\n  .h-next img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .h-hero h1{font-size:46px} .h-hero p{font-size:20px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .h-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .h-hero .txt{padding-top:40px}\n    .h-hero .txt .kicker{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:10px}\n    .h-hero h1{font-size:28px}\n    .h-hero p{font-size:15px;margin-top:12px}\n    .h-hero .pic{margin-top:10px;aspect-ratio:1024/600}\n    .h-hero .pic .pc{display:none}\n    .h-hero .pic .m{display:block}\n    .h-body{padding:60px 0}\n    .h-body .blk + .blk{margin-top:60px}\n    .h-body .lead{font-size:17px}\n    .h-slides{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,72%);gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding:4px 4px 16px;margin:24px -20px 0;padding-left:20px}\n    .h-slides img{scroll-snap-align:center;border-radius:14px}\n    .h-prep{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;max-width:320px;margin:24px auto 0}\n    .h-body .how{border-radius:16px;margin-top:24px}\n    .h-next{padding:60px 0}\n    .h-next .lead{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:24px}\n    .h-next a{border-radius:16px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 특별프로그램 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"h-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"특별프로그램\">\n      <a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"txt\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">한글 수업</span>\n      <h1>오늘부터 <em>한글 레벨업!</em></h1>\n      <p>통글자가 아닌 자음, 모음의 조합부터<br />차근 차근 배우는 흥미위주의 수업</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pic\">\n    <img class=\"pc\" src=\"/img/hangeul/hero-pc.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"960\" alt=\"한글 레벨업을 외치는 초등학생\" />\n    <img class=\"m\" src=\"/img/hangeul/hero-m.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"600\" alt=\"한글 레벨업을 외치는 초등학생\" />\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 한글 수업 소개 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"h-body\" id=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"blk\">\n      <img class=\"full anim\" data-anim=\"fadeIn\" src=\"/img/hangeul/qa.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Q. 학교에서 배우지 않을까요? A. 한글을 완전히 떼지 않은 상태에서 초등학교에 입학하게 되면 수업 진도를 따라가기 힘들어 합니다. 레벨업 한글 수업과 함께면, 아이의 성향에 맞는 수업으로 단어와 문장을 읽고 쓸 줄 알게 됩니다.\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"full anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/hangeul/ready.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"600\" alt=\"교과서 읽기, 알림장, 받아쓰기. 새로운 환경에 잘 적응할 수 있도록 한글공부를 미리 시켜주세요.\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"margin-top:30px\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blk\">\n      <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">선생님과 화상으로 교재를 보며 대화하는 수업입니다.<br />읽고 써보고 노래로 불러보며 재미있게 배웁니다.</p>\n      <div class=\"h-slides\">\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" src=\"/img/hangeul/slide-1.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"440\" alt=\"학습지 수업이 효과 없었던 아이\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" src=\"/img/hangeul/slide-2.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"440\" alt=\"한글 수업 사례 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\" src=\"/img/hangeul/slide-3.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"440\" alt=\"한글 수업 사례 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.3s\" src=\"/img/hangeul/slide-4.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"440\" alt=\"한글 수업 사례 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"h-more\"><a href=\"#contact\">더보기</a></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blk\">\n      <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">레벨업 하기 위한 수업 준비물</p>\n      <div class=\"h-prep\">\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/hangeul/prep-1.png\" width=\"534\" height=\"440\" alt=\"01 컴퓨터 또는 태블릿\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" src=\"/img/hangeul/prep-2.png\" width=\"534\" height=\"440\" alt=\"02 수업 준비물\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\" src=\"/img/hangeul/prep-3.png\" width=\"534\" height=\"440\" alt=\"03 수업 준비물\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blk\">\n      <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">레벨업 한글 과외는<br />어떻게 수업할까요?</p>\n      <div class=\"how anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/hangeul/how.jpg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"964\" alt=\"선생님과 함께하는 화상 줌수업으로 1:1 수업, 대화하며 관심사와 흥미에 맞춰 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 다음 단계 배너 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"h-next\" id=\"next\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">한글, 다음은 <em>독서·논술·수학·영어</em>까지!<br />레벨업은 아이의 전과목 성장을 함께합니다.</p>\n    <a class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" href=\"/regions\" aria-label=\"유초등 수업 바로가기\"><img src=\"/img/hangeul/next.jpg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"480\" alt=\"태블릿으로 함께 공부하는 아이들. 유초등 수업 바로가기\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"한글수업\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_hangeul_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_hangeul_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_hangeul_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_hangeul_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\" checked>한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_hangeul_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_hangeul_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_hangeul_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_hangeul_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_hangeul_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_hangeul_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/":{"title":"레벨업과외 | 초·중·고 전과목 1:1 과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>레벨업과외 | 초·중·고 전과목 1:1 과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"국어·영어·수학·사회·과학, 고등 선택·탐구과목까지. 학생의 현재 레벨에서 시작하는 초·중·고 1:1 맞춤 과외.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"레벨업과외 | 초·중·고 전과목 1:1 과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"국어·영어·수학·사회·과학, 고등 선택·탐구과목까지. 학생의 현재 레벨에서 시작하는 초·중·고 1:1 맞춤 과외.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"레벨업과외 | 초·중·고 전과목 1:1 과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"국어·영어·수학·사회·과학, 고등 선택·탐구과목까지. 학생의 현재 레벨에서 시작하는 초·중·고 1:1 맞춤 과외.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"EducationalOrganization\",\"name\":\"레벨업과외\",\"alternateName\":\"Level Up Lesson\",\"url\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\",\"logo\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\",\"telephone\":\"+82-10-3038-8978\",\"email\":\"hhhyunee3@naver.com\",\"description\":\"초·중·고 전과목 1:1 맞춤 과외. 국어·영어·수학·사회·과학, 고등 선택·탐구과목까지.\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"대한민국\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"레벨업과외\",\"url\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\",\"inLanguage\":\"ko\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-home\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">WITH LEVEL UP LESSON</p>\n    <h1>레벨업 과외와 함께라면<br />목표를 이룰 수밖에</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">스터디 플랜 관리부터 동기부여, 멘토링까지<br />맞춤형 수업으로 <strong>목표 달성 100%</strong> 보장!</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 타이밍 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"timing\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">지금이 성적 레벨업 타이밍!<br />단기간 성적 향상을 원한다면?</h2>\n    <p class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.15s\">내신, 모의고사, 수능까지<br class=\"m-br\" />맞춤형 과외로 완벽한 레벨업을 시작하세요!</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/timing-pc.jpg\" width=\"1420\" height=\"800\" alt=\"1:1 과외 수업 모습\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 코딩 배너 ───────── -->\n<a class=\"banner\" href=\"/coding\" aria-label=\"창의력 코딩 수업 알아보기\">\n  <img class=\"pc\" src=\"/img/coding-pc.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"401\" alt=\"초등 코딩 교육, 지금이 골든타임! 재밌게 게임처럼 배우는 창의력 코딩 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  <img class=\"m\" src=\"/img/coding-m.jpg\" width=\"720\" height=\"300\" alt=\"초등 코딩 교육, 지금이 골든타임! 재밌게 게임처럼 배우는 창의력 코딩 수업\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n</a>\n\n<!-- ───────── 특별한 방식 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"feat\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"head anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">레벨업 과외의<br /><em>특별한 방식</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"feat-grid\">\n      <article class=\"card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <div><p class=\"num\">special feature 01</p><h3>1:1 맞춤형 수업 진행</h3><p>학생 개개인의 수준과 목표에 맞춘 맞춤형 커리큘럼!<br />집중도 높은 1:1 수업으로 빠르게 성장 가능합니다.</p></div>\n        <img src=\"/img/feat-1.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">\n        <div><p class=\"num\">special feature 02</p><h3>전문 강사진과 체계적인 커리큘럼</h3><p>경험 많은 전문 강사진이 설계한 최적화된 커리큘럼!<br />단계별 학습으로 탄탄한 실력을 쌓을 수 있습니다.</p></div>\n        <img src=\"/img/feat-2.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <div><p class=\"num\">special feature 03</p><h3>온라인·방문 선택 가능</h3><p>집에서도 편하게? 직접 방문해서 집중적으로?<br />원하는 방식으로 수업을 선택하세요!</p></div>\n        <img src=\"/img/feat-3.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">\n        <div><p class=\"num\">special feature 04</p><h3>성적 향상 데이터 기반 코칭</h3><p>정확한 학습 진단과 데이터 분석으로 맞춤 피드백 제공!<br />성적 향상의 길을 과학적으로 안내합니다.</p></div>\n        <img src=\"/img/feat-4.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <div><p class=\"num\">special feature 05</p><h3>무료 시범 수업 30분 제공</h3><p>수업을 직접 체험해보고 결정하세요!<br />30분 무료 시범 수업으로 맞춤 학습을 경험하세요.</p></div>\n        <img src=\"/img/feat-5.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 학습후기 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"reviews\" id=\"reviews\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">왜, 레벨업 과외 인가요?</p>\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">레벨업 학습후기</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"marquee\" aria-label=\"학습후기 슬라이드\">\n    <div class=\"marquee-track\" id=\"marqueeTrack\">\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-1.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 1\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-2.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 2\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-3.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 3\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-4.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 4\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-5.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 5\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-6.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 6\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-7.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 7\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/img/review-8.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"285\" alt=\"학습후기 8\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"#contact\">레벨업 과외 상담 신청하기 <img src=\"/img/arrow.png\" alt=\"\" /></a>\n    <p class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LEVELUP LESSON</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n      <p class=\"num\">contact</p>\n      <h2>레벨업 과외 상담 신청</h2>\n      <p>학생의 현재 상황과 목표를 남겨주시면, 확인 후 빠르게 연락드립니다.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-light anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_home_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_home_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_home_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_home_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_home_grade\">학생 학년</label><select id=\"f_home_grade\" name=\"grade\"><option value=\"\">선택해주세요</option><optgroup label=\"초등\"><option>초1</option><option>초2</option><option>초3</option><option>초4</option><option>초5</option><option>초6</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"중등\"><option>중1</option><option>중2</option><option>중3</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"고등\"><option>고1</option><option>고2</option><option>고3</option><option>재수·N수</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"기타\"><option>성인</option></optgroup></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_home_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_home_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_home_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_home_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_home_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_home_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/howcoding":{"title":"코딩수업 하우코딩 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>코딩수업 하우코딩 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"코딩, 왜 배워야 할까요? 자바스크립트 앱창작 5레벨 60회차, 파이썬 데이터사이언스 5레벨 48회차. 즐겁게 놀면서 배우는 1:1 화상 코딩 수업 하우코딩.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/howcoding\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"코딩수업 하우코딩 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"코딩, 왜 배워야 할까요? 자바스크립트 앱창작 5레벨 60회차, 파이썬 데이터사이언스 5레벨 48회차. 즐겁게 놀면서 배우는 1:1 화상 코딩 수업 하우코딩.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/howcoding\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"코딩수업 하우코딩 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"코딩, 왜 배워야 할까요? 자바스크립트 앱창작 5레벨 60회차, 파이썬 데이터사이언스 5레벨 48회차. 즐겁게 놀면서 배우는 1:1 화상 코딩 수업 하우코딩.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"특별프로그램\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/geomjeong\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"코딩수업\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/howcoding\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 코딩수업 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/coding/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3;--violet:#7E57C2}\n  .d-hero{position:relative;margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:28px 0 0;background:#fff url(\"/img/coding/hero.jpg\") 50% 100%/cover no-repeat;overflow:hidden}\n  .d-hero .txt{text-align:center;padding:70px 0 380px}\n  .d-hero h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .d-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)}\n  .d-hero p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:22px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .4s both}\n  .d-sec{padding:120px 0}\n  .d-must .pts{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .d-must .pts span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:52px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:999px;background:#F2EEF9;color:var(--violet);font-size:19px;font-weight:800}\n  .d-must .tbl{max-width:1000px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .d-must .tbl img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .d-effect{background:#FAFBF8}\n  .d-penta{position:relative;max-width:900px;margin:50px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}\n  .d-penta .fig img{width:100%;height:auto}\n  .d-penta .col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px}\n  .d-penta .ef{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:22px 24px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .d-penta .ef b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--violet);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .d-penta .ef p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .d-penta .ef.top{grid-column:1/-1;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto}\n  .d-cur{background:#F2EEF9}\n  .d-cur .intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;max-width:1100px;margin:60px auto 0}\n  .d-cur .intro .v{position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}\n  .d-cur .intro .v img,.d-cur .intro .v iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;object-fit:cover}\n  .d-cur .intro .v button{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.15);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .d-cur .intro .v button span{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .d-cur .intro .v button span::after{content:\"\";margin-left:6px;border-left:24px solid var(--violet);border-top:15px solid transparent;border-bottom:15px solid transparent}\n  .d-cur .intro .t .kk{display:inline-block;background:var(--violet);color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px}\n  .d-cur .intro .t h3{font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin:14px 0 16px;line-height:1.3}\n  .d-cur .intro .t p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .d-cur .intro.rev .v{order:2}\n  .lv-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto 0}\n  .lv{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:34px 36px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -28px rgba(126,87,194,.35)}\n  .lv-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .lv-head img{width:110px;height:36px}\n  .lv-head h3{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .lv-head span{font-size:15px;color:var(--violet);font-weight:700;background:#F2EEF9;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px}\n  .lv-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\n  .lv-steps figure{margin:0}\n  .lv-steps img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px;aspect-ratio:319/197;object-fit:cover}\n  .lv-steps figcaption{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2);text-align:center;margin-top:10px}\n  .lv-desc{margin-top:22px;border-top:1px dashed #DDD;padding-top:18px}\n  .lv-desc p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .d-prep .lead{font-size:22px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:30px}\n  .d-prep .lead b{color:var(--violet)}\n  .d-play .feat{max-width:1064px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .d-play .feat img{width:100%;height:auto}\n  .d-rv{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .rv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:60px}\n  .rv{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:30px 28px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .rv img{width:64px;height:64px;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .rv h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:12px}\n  .rv p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .rv span{display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--violet)}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .d-hero h1{font-size:42px} .d-penta{grid-template-columns:1fr 320px 1fr} .rv-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .d-hero{padding-top:18px;background-size:170% auto}\n    .d-hero .txt{padding:36px 0 200px}\n    .d-hero h1{font-size:26px}\n    .d-hero p{font-size:15px;margin-top:12px}\n    .d-sec{padding:70px 0}\n    .d-must .pts span{height:42px;padding:0 16px;font-size:15px}\n    .d-must .tbl{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto}\n    .d-must .tbl img{min-width:640px;border-radius:12px}\n    .d-penta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}\n    .d-penta .fig{max-width:280px;margin:0 auto}\n    .d-penta .col{gap:12px}\n    .d-penta .ef{padding:16px 18px}\n    .d-penta .ef b{font-size:18px}\n    .d-penta .ef p{font-size:14px}\n    .d-cur .intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:30px}\n    .d-cur .intro.rev .v{order:0}\n    .d-cur .intro .v{border-radius:14px}\n    .d-cur .intro .t h3{font-size:24px}\n    .d-cur .intro .t p{font-size:15px}\n    .lv-list{gap:14px;margin-top:24px}\n    .lv{padding:22px 18px;border-radius:16px}\n    .lv-head h3{font-size:20px}\n    .lv-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}\n    .lv-steps figcaption{font-size:14px}\n    .lv-desc p{font-size:14px}\n    .d-prep .lead{font-size:16px;margin-top:18px}\n    .d-play .feat{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto}\n    .d-play .feat img{min-width:640px}\n    .rv-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}\n    .rv{padding:22px 20px}\n    .rv h3{font-size:18px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 특별프로그램 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"특별프로그램\">\n      <a class=\"on\" href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"txt\">\n      <h1>코딩, 왜 배워야 할까요?<br /><em>하우코딩</em>에서 재밌게 알려드립니다.</h1>\n      <p>미래를 준비하는 핵심 역량 '코딩'으로<br />컴퓨팅 사고력과 창의적 문제해결능력이 성장합니다!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 코딩, 필수! ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-must\" id=\"must\">\n  <div class=\"wrap center\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">코딩, 더 이상 <em>선택이 아닌 필수!</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"pts\"><span class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">초,중,고 소프트웨어(SW) 교육 의무화</span><span class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">AI를 더 잘 활용하기 위한 기초</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tbl anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/coding/sw-table.png\" width=\"1216\" height=\"364\" alt=\"초등학교·중학교·고등학교 코딩교육 교육목표, 교과내용, 창의적체험활동 표\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 학습 효과 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-effect\" id=\"effect\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">프리미엄 코딩 교육, 하우코딩<br /><em>어떤 학습 효과</em>를 얻을 수 있나요?</h2>\n    <div class=\"d-penta\">\n      <div class=\"ef top anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"><b>공부습관</b><p>자유 창작 활동으로 자기주도학습 습관 형성!</p></div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"ef anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\"><b>창의력</b><p>앱 창작을 통해 머릿속 상상을 현실로!</p></div>\n        <div class=\"ef anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.3s\"><b>성취감</b><p>나만의 앱을 만들고 실행하며 성취감 향상!</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fig anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/coding/pentagon.png\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1187\" alt=\"하우코딩 학습 효과 5각형\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"ef anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.2s\"><b>사고력</b><p>다양한 소스 활용과 프로젝트 해결로 컴퓨팅 사고력 증진!</p></div>\n        <div class=\"ef anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.4s\"><b>이해력</b><p>단계별 커리큘럼으로 코딩에 대한 이해력 상승!</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 커리큘럼 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-cur\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">우리 아이 코딩 교육, 고민 많으시죠?<br />해답은 <em>하우코딩</em>입니다!</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      <div class=\"v anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" id=\"vApp\"><img src=\"/img/coding/video-app.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"앱창작 과정 소개 영상\" loading=\"lazy\" /><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"영상 재생\" data-yt=\"xViae1rVfj0\"><span></span></button></div>\n      <div class=\"t anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\"><span class=\"kk\">총 5레벨 60회차 자바스크립트로 앱창작하기</span><h3>앱창작 과정 커리큘럼</h3><p>프로그래밍 개념 입문 ~ 응용 심화 과정까지! 자바스크립트를 사용하여 앱을 창작하는 창의 코딩 과정<br />수업마다 앱을 만드는 창작 과정에서 프로그래밍 개념과 문법을 즐겁게 학습해요!</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lv-list\">\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-1.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 01\" /><h3>프로그래밍 개념 입문</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-1-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"API 사용(기본)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>API 사용(기본)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-1-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"API 사용(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>API 사용(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-1-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"API 사용(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>API 사용(심화)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>코딩이 필요한 이유를 이해하고, 자신의 생각을 텍스트 언어로 표현하는 방법을 배워요. 모바일에서도 실행할 수 있는 다양한 주제의 앱을 직접 만들면서 텍스트 언어의 기본 사용법과 순차, 이벤트와 같은 기초 프로그래밍 개념을 완벽하게 익혀요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-2.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 02\" /><h3>프로그래밍 개념 기초</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-2-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-2-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-2-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"복제, 함수, 배열(기본)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>복제, 함수, 배열(기본)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>다양한 프로그래밍 개념이 녹아있는 앱을 스스로 제작하면서 순차, 반복, 선택 구조와 같은 주요 개념을 정확하게 이해할 수 있어요. 컴퓨터 프로그래밍의 주요 개념을 이용하여 같은 문제를 다양한 방법으로 해결해요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-3.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 03\" /><h3>프로그래밍 개념 심화</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-3-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"복제, 함수, 배열, 반복(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>복제, 함수, 배열, 반복(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-3-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"조건, 복제, 함수, 반복(응용)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>조건, 복제, 함수, 반복(응용)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-3-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건, 물리, 반복(응용)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건, 물리, 반복(응용)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>복잡한 앱을 스스로 제작하면서 복제, 함수, 배열 등과 같은 심화 프로그래밍 개념을 정확하게 이해할 수 있어요. 컴퓨터 프로그래밍의 주요 개념을 이용하여 같은 문제를 효율적인 방법으로 해결해요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-4.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 04\" /><h3>프로그래밍 응용 기초</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-4-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건, 함수, 반복(응용)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건, 함수, 반복(응용)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-4-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건, 배열(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건, 배열(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-4-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 조건, 함수(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 조건, 함수(심화)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>지금까지 학습한 프로그래밍의 주요 개념들이 다양하게 구성되어 있는 앱을 제작해요. 실제 개발에서 사용되는 다양한 프로그래밍 방법과 알고리즘을 익혀 자신의 아이디어를 효율적인 방법으로 표현할 수 있어요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-5.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 05\" /><h3>프로그래밍 응용 심화</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-5-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"함수, 반복, 조건(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>함수, 반복, 조건(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-5-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"함수, 복제, 변수(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>함수, 복제, 변수(심화)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-5-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"함수, 반복, 복제(심화)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>함수, 반복, 복제(심화)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>텍스트 코딩이 익숙하면서, 프로그래밍 심화 개념을 활용할 수 있는 학생들을 위한 과정이에요. 지금까지 학습한 프로그래밍의 주요 개념들이 복잡하게 얽혀있는 앱을 제작하고, 실제 개발 과정에 사용되는 다양한 알고리즘을 활용하여 자신의 아이디어를 효율적 방법으로 표현할 수 있어요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro rev\" style=\"margin-top:100px\">\n      <div class=\"v anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" id=\"vData\"><img src=\"/img/coding/video-data.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"데이터사이언스 과정 소개 영상\" loading=\"lazy\" /><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"영상 재생\" data-yt=\"H0Ke2ZrvVKU\"><span></span></button></div>\n      <div class=\"t anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\"><span class=\"kk\">총 5레벨 48회차 파이썬으로 데이터 분석하기</span><h3>데이터사이언스 과정 커리큘럼</h3><p>파이썬으로 데이터를 수집, 분석하고 문제를 해결하는 실전 코딩 과정!<br />몰입도 높고 흥미진진한 스토리의 주인공이 되어 다양한 실생활 문제를 해결~<br />복잡한 문제를 스스로 분해하며 프로그래밍 개념과 최신 기술을 익힐 수 있어요.</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lv-list\">\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-1.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 01\" /><h3>데이터 분석 기초</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-6-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"변수, 자료형, 제어문, 연산자\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>변수, 자료형, 제어문, 연산자</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-6-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"복합 제어문, 자료형 변환, 진법, 연산\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>복합 제어문, 자료형 변환, 진법, 연산</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-6-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"자료형(딕셔너리, 튜플, 집합)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>자료형(딕셔너리, 튜플, 집합)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>사건을 해결하기 위한 필요 데이터를 수집하고 가공하여 단서로 활용하면서 데이터 분석력을 기를 수 있어요. 변수, 자료형, 제어문 등 파이썬 기초 문법을 배우며 프로그래밍의 기본 개념을 다져요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-2.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 02\" /><h3>데이터 분석 심화</h3><span>2단계 과정(총 8회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-7-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"사용자 정의 함수, 반복 흐름 제어\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>사용자 정의 함수, 반복 흐름 제어</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-7-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"모듈, 연산(교체, 비트)\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>모듈, 연산(교체, 비트)</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>사용자 함수를 정의하고 호출하여 실행하는 방법을 배워 프로그램의 효율성을 높이고 프로그래밍 능력을 향상시킬 수 있어요. 파이썬에서 제공하는 모듈을 사용함으로써 복잡한 문제를 쉽게 해결하며 프로그래밍의 심화 개념을 다져요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-3.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 03\" /><h3>자료구조 기초</h3><span>3단계 과정(총 12회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-8-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"클래스, 모듈(openCV), 해시함수\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>클래스, 모듈(openCV), 해시함수</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-8-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"자료구조&amp;알고리즘 기초, 스택, 큐\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>자료구조&amp;알고리즘 기초, 스택, 큐</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-8-3.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"그래프, 인접행렬, 다익스트라 알고리즘\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>그래프, 인접행렬, 다익스트라 알고리즘</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>객체 지향 프로그래밍의 원리를 이해하고 클래스를 사용하는 방법을 배우며 스택, 큐, 그래프 자료구조를 익혀요. 연산의 성능과 데이터 등록 순서에 따라 데이터를 다르게 처리하는 알고리즘을 구현해요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-4.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 04\" /><h3>자료구조 심화</h3><span>2단계 과정(총 8회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-9-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"트리, 트리탐색, 재귀&amp;선택 정렬 알고리즘\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>트리, 트리탐색, 재귀&amp;선택 정렬 알고리즘</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-9-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"탐색&amp;Convex hull 알고리즘, DFS 탐색\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>탐색&amp;Convex hull 알고리즘, DFS 탐색</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>재귀, 정렬, 탐색 알고리즘 등의 원리를 이해하고 구현해보면서 프로그램 실행 로직을 효율적으로 구체화해요. 파이썬 문법을 응용하면서 자료구조 및 알고리즘의 심화 개념을 다져요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lv anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">\n        <div class=\"lv-head\"><img src=\"/img/coding/level-5.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"36\" alt=\"LEVEL 05\" /><h3>인공지능 기초</h3><span>2단계 과정(총 8회차)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-steps\"><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-10-1.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"데이터 시각화 및 분석, 파일 입출력\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>데이터 시각화 및 분석, 파일 입출력</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/img/coding/step-10-2.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"197\" alt=\"인공지능, 지도학습, 비지도 학습, 신경망\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption>인공지능, 지도학습, 비지도 학습, 신경망</figcaption></figure></div>\n        <div class=\"lv-desc\"><p>파이썬의 다양한 라이브러리를 사용하여 CSV 파일 속 데이터를 수집하고 가공하여 데이터를 시각화하고 분석하는 방법을 배워요. 빅데이터 및 인공지능의 기초 개념을 이해하고 활용해요.</p></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 코딩을 잘하려면 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-prep\" id=\"prep\">\n  <div class=\"wrap center\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">코딩을 잘하려면<br /><em>어떻게 준비하는게 좋을까요?</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">방법은 하나! <b>자바스크립트와 파이썬은 기본!</b> Java, C, C++까지.<br />하우코딩에서는 학생부터 성인까지, 목적에 맞춘 1:1 커리큘럼으로<br />진로는 물론 실무 활용까지 함께 준비합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 1:1 화상 코딩 수업 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-play\" id=\"play\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap center\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">즐겁게 놀면서 배우는<br /><em>1:1 화상 코딩 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"feat anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/coding/features.png\" width=\"1064\" height=\"288\" alt=\"FEATURE 01 맞춤형 커리큘럼: 학년 무관, 학생 수준 맞춤, 매단계 업창작. FEATURE 02 실시간 수업: 1:1 온라인 수업, 전문코치 중, 어디서나 가능. FEATURE 03 차별화 학습: 단계테스트, 수업피드백, 자유창작\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 후기 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"d-sec d-rv\" id=\"reviews\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">하우코딩이 어떤지 궁금하신가요?<br />이미 많은 학생들이 <em>하우코딩을 경험</em>하고 있습니다!</h2>\n    <div class=\"rv-grid\">\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.08s\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-1.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>영어실력, 코딩실력도 향상되고<br />점점 더 똑똑해지는 느낌</h3><p>영어실력도 많이 는 것 같고 코딩실력도 느는 것 같고 점점 더 똑똑해지는 느낌입니다.</p><span>이루* 회원</span></article>\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.16s\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-2.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>상상하던 것을<br />만들어내는 즐거움</h3><p>마음대로 그리고 붙여서 스프라이트를 추가하고 실행하는 게 재밌어요! 실험해보니까 진짜로 제가 상상하던게 나와서 신기했어요!</p><span>고예* 회원</span></article>\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-3.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>제가 생각하는 아이디어로<br />명령문을 만들 수 있게 되었어요.</h3><p>수업을 하기 전에는 영어도, 컴퓨터도 전혀 못 했었는데요. 이제는 제가 생각하는 아이디어로 명령문을 바꿔서 원하는 게임을 만들 수 있게 되었어요.</p><span>홍성* 회원</span></article>\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.08s\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-4.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>창작의 순수한 기쁨을<br />느낄 수 있어서 좋았습니다.</h3><p>고등학생인 저도 재미있게 들을 수 있었어요. 수업을 들으면서 창작의 순수한 기쁨을 느낄 수 있어서 좋았습니다.</p><span>지현* 회원</span></article>\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.16s\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-5.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>제가 생각하는 아이디어로<br />명령문을 만들 수 있게 되었어요.</h3><p>수업을 하기 전에는 영어도, 컴퓨터도 전혀 못 했었는데요. 이제는 제가 생각하는 아이디어로 명령문을 바꿔서 원하는 게임을 만들 수 있게 되었어요.</p><span>조한* 회원</span></article>\n      <article class=\"rv anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"><img src=\"/img/coding/avatar-6.png\" width=\"81\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><h3>게임의 원리와 과정을<br />알아가는 재미에 빠졌어요!</h3><p>텍스트 코딩이 처음이어서 어려워하지 않을까 걱정했는데 전문코치님이 친절하고 쉽게 설명해 주셔서 게임의 원리와 과정을 알아가는 재미에 빠졌어요!</p><span>홍현* 회원 학부모님</span></article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"코딩수업\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_howcoding_name\">학생 이름 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_howcoding_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"학생 이름\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_howcoding_phone1\">학부모 연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_howcoding_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\" checked>코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\">외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_howcoding_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_howcoding_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_howcoding_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_howcoding_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_howcoding_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_howcoding_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>\n  // 유튜브 영상: 누르면 그때 불러온다\n  document.querySelectorAll('.d-cur .v button[data-yt]').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const box = b.parentElement; const f = document.createElement('iframe');\n      f.src = 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/' + b.dataset.yt + '?autoplay=1&rel=0';\n      f.allow = 'accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture'; f.allowFullscreen = true; f.title = '하우코딩 소개 영상';\n      box.innerHTML = ''; box.appendChild(f);\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/japanese-business":{"title":"비즈니스 일본어 과외 | 직장인 일본어 회화·경어 1:1 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>비즈니스 일본어 과외 | 직장인 일본어 회화·경어 1:1 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 일본어 1:1 과외. 경어(존경어·겸양어), 전화·이메일·회의·출장 일본어를 본인 업무 상황으로 연습. 일본 거래처·주재원·취업 준비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-business\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"비즈니스 일본어 과외 | 직장인 일본어 회화·경어 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 일본어 1:1 과외. 경어(존경어·겸양어), 전화·이메일·회의·출장 일본어를 본인 업무 상황으로 연습. 일본 거래처·주재원·취업 준비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-business\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"비즈니스 일본어 과외 | 직장인 일본어 회화·경어 1:1 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"직장인 비즈니스 일본어 1:1 과외. 경어(존경어·겸양어), 전화·이메일·회의·출장 일본어를 본인 업무 상황으로 연습. 일본 거래처·주재원·취업 준비, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"일본어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"비즈니스 일본어 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-business\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"일본어 기초가 약한데 바로 비즈니스로 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"기초 문형이 없으면 4주 정도 기초를 먼저 잡고 비즈니스 과정으로 넘어갑니다. 진단 후 정합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"회사 자료를 가져가도 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 실제 메일, 발표 자료를 가져오시면 그걸로 수업합니다. 대외비 부분은 가려서 주시면 됩니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"수업 시간대는요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"출근 전 아침 7시, 점심시간, 퇴근 후 저녁 10시까지 가능합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"BJT(비즈니스 일본어 능력시험) 대비도 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. BJT J2·J1 목표로 청해·독해 실무 문제를 다루는 과정이 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"비즈니스 일본어 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"비즈니스 일본어 과외\", \"description\": \"직장인 비즈니스 일본어 1:1 과외. 경어(존경어·겸양어), 전화·이메일·회의·출장 일본어를 본인 업무 상황으로 연습. 일본 거래처·주재원·취업 준비, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 비즈니스 일본어 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화</a> › <span>비즈니스 일본어 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Business Japanese</span>\n        <h1>비즈니스 일본어 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">일본 거래처와 일하다 보면 회화보다 &#x27;경어&#x27;와 &#x27;비즈니스 관습&#x27;에서 막힙니다. 존경어·겸양어를 상황별로 정리하고, 전화 응대, 이메일, 회의, 출장, 접대까지 본인 업무를 그대로 가져와 연습합니다. 일본 기업 근무 경험이 있는 선생님이 맡습니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/jp/hero.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"비즈니스 일본어 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본 거래처와 메일·전화를 주고받는 직장인</b><p>실제 메일과 통화 상황을 가져오면 표현을 고쳐 드립니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본 주재원·파견을 앞둔 분</b><p>회의·보고·거래처 방문 등 부임 후 첫 3개월 상황을 집중 연습합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본 기업 취업·이직을 준비하는 분</b><p>이력서(履歴書), 면접 경어, 자기 PR을 준비합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>업무 상황 파악</b><p>어떤 상대(거래처·상사·고객)와 어떤 일(메일·회의·전화)을 하는지 정리합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>경어 체계 정리</b><p>존경어·겸양어·정중어를 표로 정리하고 자주 쓰는 동사 30개를 먼저 익힙니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>상황별 롤플레이</b><p>전화 받기·걸기, 회의 발언, 거래처 방문 인사를 선생님과 실제처럼 연습합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>실무 첨삭</b><p>본인이 쓴 메일·보고서를 첨삭하고 더 자연스러운 표현으로 바꿉니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>기초</td><td>비즈니스 인사, 명함 교환, 자기소개, 기본 경어</td><td>첫 만남 대응</td></tr><tr><td>전화·이메일</td><td>전화 응대 표현, 이메일 형식과 관용구, 일정 조율</td><td>메일·전화 혼자 처리</td></tr><tr><td>회의·보고</td><td>회의 진행 표현, 보고·제안, 반대 의견 정중하게 말하기</td><td>회의에서 발언하기</td></tr><tr><td>출장·접대</td><td>거래처 방문, 식사 자리 대화, 사과·감사 표현</td><td>출장 일정 전체 대응</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">일본어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/japanese#teachers\">일본어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>일본어 기초가 약한데 바로 비즈니스로 되나요?</summary><p>기초 문형이 없으면 4주 정도 기초를 먼저 잡고 비즈니스 과정으로 넘어갑니다. 진단 후 정합니다.</p></details><details><summary>회사 자료를 가져가도 되나요?</summary><p>네. 실제 메일, 발표 자료를 가져오시면 그걸로 수업합니다. 대외비 부분은 가려서 주시면 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>수업 시간대는요?</summary><p>출근 전 아침 7시, 점심시간, 퇴근 후 저녁 10시까지 가능합니다.</p></details><details><summary>BJT(비즈니스 일본어 능력시험) 대비도 하나요?</summary><p>네. BJT J2·J1 목표로 청해·독해 실무 문제를 다루는 과정이 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>일본어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/japanese-online\">화상 일본어 과외</a><a href=\"/japanese-jlpt\">JLPT·JPT 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"비즈니스 일본어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanesebusiness_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_japanesebusiness_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanesebusiness_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_japanesebusiness_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_japanesebusiness_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_japanesebusiness_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_japanesebusiness_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_japanesebusiness_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_japanesebusiness_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_japanesebusiness_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/japanese-jlpt":{"title":"JLPT·JPT 과외 | N1·N2 1:1 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>JLPT·JPT 과외 | N1·N2 1:1 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"JLPT N3·N2·N1, JPT 목표 점수 1:1 과외. 문자·어휘·문법·독해·청해 영역별 약점 진단, 기출 분석과 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·승진 기한 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-jlpt\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"JLPT·JPT 과외 | N1·N2 1:1 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"JLPT N3·N2·N1, JPT 목표 점수 1:1 과외. 문자·어휘·문법·독해·청해 영역별 약점 진단, 기출 분석과 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·승진 기한 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-jlpt\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"JLPT·JPT 과외 | N1·N2 1:1 시험 대비 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"JLPT N3·N2·N1, JPT 목표 점수 1:1 과외. 문자·어휘·문법·독해·청해 영역별 약점 진단, 기출 분석과 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·승진 기한 대비, 무료 체험.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"일본어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"JLPT·JPT 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-jlpt\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"몇 달 잡아야 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"N3→N2는 3~4개월, N2→N1은 5~6개월을 보통 잡습니다. 주 2회 기준이며 집중 과정은 더 짧습니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"청해가 제일 약한데 방법이 있나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"원어민 선생님과 받아쓰기·섀도잉을 매 수업 10분씩 하고, 기출 청해를 유형별로 반복합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"교재는 어떤 걸 쓰나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"급수별 종합서와 기출문제집을 기본으로 하고, 약한 영역은 선생님 자체 정리 자료를 씁니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"JLPT와 JPT 중 어느 것을 봐야 하나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"취업·유학 대부분은 JLPT, 일부 기업은 JPT 점수를 요구합니다. 지원처 요건을 먼저 확인하세요.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"JLPT·JPT 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"JLPT·JPT 과외\", \"description\": \"JLPT N3·N2·N1, JPT 목표 점수 1:1 과외. 문자·어휘·문법·독해·청해 영역별 약점 진단, 기출 분석과 모의고사로 시험일에 맞춘 집중 계획. 취업·유학·승진 기한 대비, 무료 체험.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: JLPT·JPT 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화</a> › <span>JLPT·JPT 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">JLPT · JPT</span>\n        <h1>JLPT·JPT <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">JLPT는 급수마다 문법과 어휘 범위가 정해져 있어서, 범위를 정확히 알고 약한 영역을 집중하면 점수가 빨리 오릅니다. 1:1로 문자·어휘·문법·독해·청해 5개 영역을 진단하고, 시험일까지 주 단위 계획으로 기출과 모의고사를 돌립니다. JPT는 파트별 시간 전략 위주로 준비합니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/jp/hero.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"JLPT·JPT 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>취업·승진에 N2 이상이 필요한 분</b><p>시험일까지 남은 기간으로 역산해 주 3~4회 집중 과정을 짭니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>독학으로 N3까지 왔는데 N2에서 막힌 분</b><p>N2부터는 독해 속도와 청해가 관건입니다. 시간 전략과 청해 훈련을 집중합니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본 유학·대학원 지원에 N1이 필요한 분</b><p>고급 문법 150개, 어휘 3,000개를 기간 안에 정리합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>모의 진단</b><p>급수별 축약 모의고사로 영역별 정답률을 확인합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>범위 정리</b><p>해당 급수의 문법·어휘 목록을 주 단위로 배분하고 암기 확인 방식을 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>영역별 수업</b><p>문법·독해는 한국인 선생님, 청해는 원어민 선생님으로 나눠 진행할 수 있습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>모의고사 관리</b><p>시험 4주 전부터 매주 풀세트 모의고사로 점수 추이를 관리합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>N4·N3</td><td>기초 문법 완성, 어휘 1,500, 짧은 독해·청해</td><td>N3 합격</td></tr><tr><td>N2</td><td>문법 200개, 어휘 3,000, 장문 독해 시간 전략, 청해 유형별</td><td>N2 합격 (총점 120+)</td></tr><tr><td>N1</td><td>고급 문법·관용 표현, 어휘 5,000, 신문·논설 독해</td><td>N1 합격</td></tr><tr><td>JPT</td><td>파트별 시간 배분, 청해 속도, 오답 유형 분석</td><td>목표 점수(700/800/900)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">일본어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/japanese#teachers\">일본어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>몇 달 잡아야 하나요?</summary><p>N3→N2는 3~4개월, N2→N1은 5~6개월을 보통 잡습니다. 주 2회 기준이며 집중 과정은 더 짧습니다.</p></details><details><summary>청해가 제일 약한데 방법이 있나요?</summary><p>원어민 선생님과 받아쓰기·섀도잉을 매 수업 10분씩 하고, 기출 청해를 유형별로 반복합니다.</p></details><details><summary>교재는 어떤 걸 쓰나요?</summary><p>급수별 종합서와 기출문제집을 기본으로 하고, 약한 영역은 선생님 자체 정리 자료를 씁니다.</p></details><details><summary>JLPT와 JPT 중 어느 것을 봐야 하나요?</summary><p>취업·유학 대부분은 JLPT, 일부 기업은 JPT 점수를 요구합니다. 지원처 요건을 먼저 확인하세요.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>일본어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/japanese-online\">화상 일본어 과외</a><a href=\"/japanese-business\">비즈니스 일본어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"JLPT·JPT\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanesejlpt_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_japanesejlpt_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanesejlpt_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_japanesejlpt_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_japanesejlpt_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_japanesejlpt_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_japanesejlpt_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_japanesejlpt_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_japanesejlpt_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_japanesejlpt_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/japanese-online":{"title":"화상 일본어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 일본어 회화 - 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>화상 일본어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 일본어 회화 - 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 일본어 회화. 히라가나부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·애니·비즈니스 등 관심 주제로 말하기. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-online\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"화상 일본어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 일본어 회화 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 일본어 회화. 히라가나부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·애니·비즈니스 등 관심 주제로 말하기. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-online\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"화상 일본어 과외 | 원어민 1:1 온라인 일본어 회화 - 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 일본어 회화. 히라가나부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·애니·비즈니스 등 관심 주제로 말하기. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"홈\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"일본어 회화\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"화상 일본어 과외\", \"item\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese-online\"}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"히라가나도 모르는데 원어민 수업이 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"한국어가 가능한 일본인 선생님이나 한국인 선생님으로 시작해 기초를 잡은 뒤 원어민 프리토킹으로 넘어갑니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"수업 시간은 어떻게 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"회당 40·50분, 주 1~3회. 평일 저녁과 주말도 가능합니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"교재는 무엇을 쓰나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"기초는 '민나노 니혼고' 계열 교재, 이후에는 관심 주제 자료와 선생님 자체 자료를 씁니다.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"JLPT 준비도 같이 되나요?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"네. 회화와 JLPT를 병행하거나, 시험 전 JLPT 집중 과정으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"화상 일본어 과외\", \"serviceType\": \"화상 일본어 과외\", \"description\": \"원어민·이중언어 선생님과 1:1 화상 일본어 회화. 히라가나부터 프리토킹까지 레벨 진단 후 맞춤 수업, 여행·애니·비즈니스 등 관심 주제로 말하기. 전국 어디서나, 무료 체험수업.\", \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"대한민국\"}, \"provider\": {\"@type\": \"EducationalOrganization\", \"name\": \"레벨업과외\", \"url\": \"https://level-up-lesson.com/\", \"telephone\": \"+82-10-3038-8978\"}}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* 자동 생성: src/gen_keyword_pages.py 에서 만듭니다. 공통 스타일은 shell 의 .kw-* 를 씁니다. */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 키워드 페이지: 화상 일본어 과외 (자동 생성 — src/gen_keyword_pages.py 수정 후 재실행) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"kw-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">홈</a> › <a href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화</a> › <span>화상 일본어 과외</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kw-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kw-txt\">\n        <span class=\"kw-kicker\">Online Japanese</span>\n        <h1>화상 일본어 <em>과외</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"kw-lead\">집에서 줌으로 만나는 1:1 일본어 회화입니다. 한국어가 가능한 일본인 선생님과 한국인 일본어 전공 선생님 중 고를 수 있어서, 히라가나를 처음 배우는 분도 부담 없이 시작합니다. 여행, 애니메이션, 드라마, 업무 등 배우고 싶은 이유에 맞춰 수업 소재를 정합니다.</p>\n        <div class=\"kw-cta\"><a class=\"pri\" href=\"#contact\">무료 체험수업 신청</a><a class=\"ghost\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화 상담 010-3038-8978</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kw-pic anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\"><img src=\"/img/jp/hero.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"화상 일본어 과외 수업 모습\" /></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"who\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">이런 분께 <em>맞는 수업</em>입니다</h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-whos\"><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본어를 처음 시작하는 분</b><p>히라가나·가타카나부터 기초 문형 50개까지 8주 안에 잡는 입문 과정.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>혼자 공부해서 읽기는 되는데 말은 안 되는 분</b><p>독학·인강으로 문법은 아는데 대화가 안 되는 경우. 말하기 70% 수업으로 바꿉니다.</p></div><div class=\"kw-who\"><b>일본 여행·워킹홀리데이·유학을 앞둔 분</b><p>공항·식당·숙소·관공서 상황을 그대로 연습합니다.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">수업은 <em>이렇게 진행</em>됩니다</h2>\n    <ol class=\"kw-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><b>레벨 진단</b><p>간단한 대화와 읽기로 수준을 확인하고 선생님(원어민·한국인)을 정합니다.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>주제 설정</b><p>여행·일상·애니·비즈니스 중 관심 주제로 첫 달 커리큘럼을 짭니다.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>1:1 화상 수업</b><p>줌 화면에 교재를 띄우고 말하기 중심으로 진행. 수업 후 교정 노트와 음성 파일을 받습니다.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>월 점검</b><p>월말 5분 프리토킹 녹음으로 늘어난 부분을 확인하고 다음 달 목표를 정합니다.</p></div></li></ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"curriculum\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">단계별 <em>커리큘럼</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">레벨 진단 결과에 따라 시작 단계를 정하고, 목표에 맞춰 단계를 조정합니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>수업 내용</th><th>목표</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>입문</td><td>히라가나·가타카나, 인사, 기본 문형(です·ます)</td><td>자기소개와 간단한 질문</td></tr><tr><td>초급</td><td>동사 활용, 일상 회화 100문장, 숫자·시간·쇼핑</td><td>여행에서 필요한 말 하기</td></tr><tr><td>중급</td><td>경어 기초, 의견 말하기, 드라마·뉴스 소재</td><td>10분 이상 대화</td></tr><tr><td>고급</td><td>프리토킹, 경어 완성, 시사·문화 토론</td><td>원어민과 자연스러운 대화</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">일본어 강사진 (일부)</h2>\n    <p class=\"s-sub\">학력·경력·모의수업으로 검증한 선생님 중 학생의 목표와 성향에 맞는 분을 배정합니다. 전체 강사진은 <a href=\"/japanese#teachers\">일본어 회화 메인</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"kw-teachers\"><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"일본어 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">자주 묻는 <em>질문</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-faq\"><details open><summary>히라가나도 모르는데 원어민 수업이 되나요?</summary><p>한국어가 가능한 일본인 선생님이나 한국인 선생님으로 시작해 기초를 잡은 뒤 원어민 프리토킹으로 넘어갑니다.</p></details><details><summary>수업 시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>회당 40·50분, 주 1~3회. 평일 저녁과 주말도 가능합니다.</p></details><details><summary>교재는 무엇을 쓰나요?</summary><p>기초는 &#x27;민나노 니혼고&#x27; 계열 교재, 이후에는 관심 주제 자료와 선생님 자체 자료를 씁니다.</p></details><details><summary>JLPT 준비도 같이 되나요?</summary><p>네. 회화와 JLPT를 병행하거나, 시험 전 JLPT 집중 과정으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p></details></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"kw-sec kw-alt\" id=\"related\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2\">함께 보는 <em>일본어 수업</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"kw-rel\"><a class=\"main\" href=\"/japanese\">일본어 회화 메인 보기</a><a href=\"/japanese-jlpt\">JLPT·JPT 과외</a><a href=\"/japanese-business\">비즈니스 일본어 과외</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 체험수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"화상 일본어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japaneseonline_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_japaneseonline_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japaneseonline_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_japaneseonline_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_japaneseonline_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_japaneseonline_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_japaneseonline_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_japaneseonline_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_japaneseonline_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_japaneseonline_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/japanese":{"title":"일본어 회화 · 레벨업과외","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>일본어 회화 · 레벨업과외</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"지금이 바로 일본어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 기초부터 JLPT·JPT·비즈니스 일본어까지 1:1 학습 프로그램. 한국어가 능통한 일본인·전공 강사진이 함께합니다.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"일본어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 일본어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 기초부터 JLPT·JPT·비즈니스 일본어까지 1:1 학습 프로그램. 한국어가 능통한 일본인·전공 강사진이 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"레벨업과외\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"일본어 회화 · 레벨업과외\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"지금이 바로 일본어 실력 레벨업 타이밍! 기초부터 JLPT·JPT·비즈니스 일본어까지 1:1 학습 프로그램. 한국어가 능통한 일본인·전공 강사진이 함께합니다.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://level-up-lesson.com/logo.png\" />\n{{VERIFY}}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"홈\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"외국어\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/english-conversation\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"일본어\",\"item\":\"https://level-up-lesson.com/japanese\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n\n<style>\n  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     이미지 교체 안내\n     public/img/ 폴더의 파일을 같은 이름으로 바꾸면 그대로 반영됩니다.\n       hero-pc.jpg   PC 메인 배경 (1920×1080 권장)\n       hero-m.jpg    모바일 메인 배경 (720×600 권장)\n       timing-pc.jpg \"성적 레벨업 타이밍\" 사진 (1420×800)\n       coding-pc.jpg PC 코딩 배너 (1920×401) / coding-m.jpg 모바일 (720×300)\n       feat-1~5.png  특별한 방식 아이콘 (500×500, 투명 배경)\n       review-1~8.jpg 학습후기 카드 (285×285 정사각형)\n       logo-levelup.png 상단 로고 (245×48)\n       float-kakao.png / float-inquiry.png 플로팅 버튼 (80×80)\n       arrow.png 상담 신청 화살표 (30×30)\n     ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  :root{\n    --blue:#2196F3;        /* 시그니처 파랑 (imweb 원본) */\n    --blue-2:#1E88E5;\n    --blue-light:#4DABF5;\n    --blue-pale:#E9F5FE;   /* 카드 배경 */\n    --blue-txt:#BADEFB;    /* 파란 섹션 보조 텍스트 */\n    --purple:#7E57C2;      /* 코딩 배너 */\n    --ink:#222222;\n    --ink-2:#333333;\n    --muted:#777777;\n    --white:#ffffff;\n    --dark:#222222;        /* 모바일 하단 바 */\n    --maxw:1200px;\n    --hd-h:72px;\n    --font:\"Pretendard\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--white);line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;overflow-x:hidden}\n  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n\n  /* ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb: slideInUp / fadeInUp / zoomIn, 0.7s) ── */\n  .anim{opacity:0}\n  .anim.in{opacity:1;animation-duration:.7s;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeInUp\"]{animation-name:fadeInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"slideInUp\"]{animation-name:slideInUp}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"zoomIn\"]{animation-name:zoomIn}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"fadeIn\"]{animation-name:fadeIn}\n  @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,40px,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes slideInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translate3d(0,60%,0)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes zoomIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale3d(.85,.85,.85)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .anim{opacity:1!important;animation:none!important}\n    .marquee-track{animation:none!important}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 헤더 ── */\n  .hd{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:var(--hd-h);background:var(--white);transition:box-shadow .25s}\n  .hd.scrolled{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n  .hd .wrap{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}\n  .hd .logo img{height:28px;width:auto}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1;justify-content:center}\n  .nav > li{position:relative}\n  .nav > li > a{display:block;padding:10px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;border-radius:8px;transition:color .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover > a,.nav > li > a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .nav .sub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:100%;transform:translate(-50%,8px);min-width:180px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 0;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,visibility .2s}\n  .nav > li:hover .sub,.nav > li:focus-within .sub{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n  .nav .sub a{display:block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}\n  .nav .sub a:hover{background:var(--blue-pale);color:var(--blue)}\n  .hd-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:42px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .hd-cta:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s,top .25s}\n  .burger span:nth-child(1){top:14px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:21px}.burger span:nth-child(3){top:28px}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(1){top:21px;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}\n  body.menu-open .burger span:nth-child(3){top:21px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}\n\n  /* 모바일 드로어 메뉴 */\n  .drawer{position:fixed;top:var(--hd-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--white);z-index:99;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .3s ease;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 24px 120px;display:none}\n  body.menu-open .drawer{transform:none}\n  .drawer .grp{border-bottom:1px solid #eee}\n  .drawer .grp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .drawer .grp-row > a{flex:1;display:block;padding:16px 4px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\n  .drawer .grp-tg{width:48px;height:48px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n  .drawer .grp-tg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:18px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid #999;border-bottom:2px solid #999;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .25s}\n  .drawer .grp.open .grp-tg::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:21px}\n  .drawer .grp ul{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}\n  .drawer .grp.open ul{max-height:400px}\n  .drawer .grp ul a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#555}\n  .drawer .grp ul a:hover{color:var(--blue)}\n  .drawer .drawer-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:50px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n\n  /* ── 히어로 ── */\n  .hero{position:relative;height:min(100vh,960px);min-height:600px;margin-top:var(--hd-h);background:#fff url(\"/img/hero-pc.jpg\") center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%)}\n  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}\n  .hero .eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .1s both}\n  .hero h1{font-size:64px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;margin:26px 0 44px;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .3s both}\n  .hero .lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:400;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .55s both}\n  .hero .lead strong{font-weight:800}\n\n  /* ── 타이밍 섹션 ── */\n  .timing{padding:120px 0 0;text-align:center}\n  .timing h2{font-size:60px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .timing p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-top:34px}\n  .timing .pic{margin-top:60px}\n  .timing .pic img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1420/800}\n\n  /* ── 코딩 배너 ── */\n  .banner{background:var(--purple);display:block}\n  .banner img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1920/401}\n  .banner .m{aspect-ratio:720/300}\n  .banner .m{display:none}\n\n  /* ── 특별한 방식 ── */\n  .feat{padding:200px 0}\n  .feat .head{font-size:48px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:60px}\n  .feat .head em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px}\n  .card{background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:20px;padding:44px 44px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;min-height:320px;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 44px -20px rgba(33,150,243,.35)}\n  .card .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .card h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:26px}\n  .card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .card img{width:140px;height:140px;flex:0 0 140px;object-fit:contain}\n  /* PC: 지그재그 배치 (imweb 원본처럼 오른쪽 열이 한 칸 아래로) */\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(120px)}\n  .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(114px)}\n  .feat-grid::after{content:\"\";display:block;height:120px;grid-column:1/-1}\n\n  /* ── 학습후기 (파란 섹션) ── */\n  .reviews{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:90px 0 70px;overflow:hidden}\n  .reviews .eyebrow{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--blue-txt)}\n  .reviews h2{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:6px 0 50px}\n  .marquee{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%}\n  .marquee-track{display:flex;gap:16px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 46s linear infinite;will-change:transform}\n  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{animation-play-state:paused}\n  .marquee-track .item{flex:0 0 auto;width:285px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .marquee-track .item img{width:285px;height:285px;object-fit:cover}\n  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0)}}\n  .reviews .cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:70px auto 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;transition:transform .25s}\n  .reviews .cta:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}\n  .reviews .cta img{width:30px;height:30px}\n  .reviews .mark{margin-top:40px;text-align:right;font-size:96px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff;opacity:.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;user-select:none}\n\n  /* ── 상담 신청 ── */\n  .contact{padding:120px 0}\n  .contact .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}\n  .contact .head .num{font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:var(--blue)}\n  .contact .head h2{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.3;margin-top:6px}\n  .contact .head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\n  .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--blue-pale);border-radius:24px;padding:48px}\n  .form-card.on-blue{background:#fff;margin-top:40px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .form-card.on-blue .field label{color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .form-card.on-blue input[readonly]{background:#F6FAFD}\n  .form-card.on-blue .btn-submit{background:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-card.on-blue .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--accent,var(--blue));border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .field label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .field .req{color:#E53935}\n  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .field textarea{height:130px;padding:14px 16px;resize:vertical}\n  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(33,150,243,.15)}\n  .field input[readonly]{background:#f6fafd;color:#555}\n  .phone-3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .phone-3 input{text-align:center;padding:0 6px}\n  .phone-sep{color:#999}\n  .subj-pick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .subj-pick label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e6f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n  .subj-pick label:has(input:checked){background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .subj-pick input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;accent-color:var(--blue)}\n  .addr-row{display:flex;gap:8px}\n  .addr-row input{flex:1}\n  .addr-btn{height:50px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n  .field.full input + input{margin-top:8px}\n  .btn-submit{width:100%;height:56px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}\n  .btn-submit:hover{background:var(--blue-2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default;transform:none}\n  .form-note{font-size:13px;color:#888;text-align:center;margin-top:14px}\n  .hp-field{position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}\n  .form-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:30px 0}\n  .form-success.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .6s both}\n  .form-success .ok{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px}\n  .form-success .ok svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:#fff}\n  .form-success h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .form-success p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\n\n\n  /* ── 플로팅 버튼 ── */\n  .flo-pc{position:fixed;right:40px;bottom:40px;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n  .flo-pc a{display:block;width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .2s}\n  .flo-pc a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .flo-pc img{width:80px;height:80px}\n  .flo-m{display:none;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:var(--dark);height:56px}\n  .flo-m a{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}\n  .flo-m a + a{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}\n\n  /* ── 하위 페이지 공통 컴포넌트 (--accent 로 페이지 색을 정한다) ── */\n  .s-h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .s-h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent,var(--blue))}\n  .s-sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px}\n  .center{text-align:center}\n  .ptabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n  .ptabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}\n  .ptabs a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .ptabs a.on{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff}\n  .sub-cta{background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;padding:100px 0}\n  .sub-cta h2{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-align:center}\n  .sub-cta .tel{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n  .mini-form{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .mini-form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .mini-form label{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .mini-form input[type=text],.mini-form input[type=tel],.mini-form textarea{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:0 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}\n  .mini-form textarea{height:120px;padding:12px 14px;resize:vertical}\n  .mini-form input:focus,.mini-form textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n  .mini-form .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .mini-form .phone input{text-align:center;padding:0 4px}\n  .mini-form .phone span{color:#999}\n  .mini-form .agree{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .mini-form .agree input{accent-color:var(--accent,var(--blue));width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .mini-form .agree-toggle{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent,var(--blue));text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}\n  .mini-form .agree-text{display:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;background:#F7F8F9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .mini-form .agree-text.open{display:block}\n  .mini-form .btn{width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,var(--blue));color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .2s,transform .2s}\n  .mini-form .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .mini-form .btn:disabled{opacity:.6;transform:none}\n  .mini-done{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0}\n  .mini-done.show{display:block;animation:fadeInUp .5s both}\n  .mini-done b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}\n  @keyframes flipInY{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateY(-70deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n  .anim.in[data-anim=\"flipInY\"]{animation-name:flipInY;animation-duration:.8s}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .s-h2{font-size:38px} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .s-h2{font-size:26px}\n    .s-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}\n    .ptabs{gap:6px}\n    .ptabs a{height:36px;padding:0 13px;font-size:13px}\n    .sub-cta{padding:60px 0}\n    .sub-cta h2{font-size:26px}\n    .sub-cta .tel{font-size:24px}\n    .mini-form{padding:24px 18px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:28px}\n    .mini-form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 키워드 수업 페이지 (src/gen_keyword_pages.py 로 생성) ── */\n  .kw-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:36px 0 70px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E9F5FE,#fff)}\n  .kw-crumb{font-size:13px;color:#7A8FA0;margin-bottom:26px}\n  .kw-crumb a{color:#7A8FA0}\n  .kw-crumb span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n  .kw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}\n  .kw-kicker{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .kw-txt h1{font-size:46px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .kw-txt h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:20px}\n  .kw-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n  .kw-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:50px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}\n  .kw-cta .pri{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px -12px rgba(33,150,243,.6)}\n  .kw-cta .ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:2px solid var(--blue)}\n  .kw-pic img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .kw-sec{padding:90px 0}\n  .kw-alt{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .kw-whos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-who{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}\n  .kw-who b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4}\n  .kw-who p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n  .kw-steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n  .kw-steps span{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .kw-steps b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .kw-steps p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-table{margin-top:30px;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #E3ECF3}\n  .kw-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px}\n  .kw-table th{background:#E9F5FE;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 18px;text-align:left}\n  .kw-table td{padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid #EEF3F7;vertical-align:top}\n  .kw-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}\n  .kw-teachers{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .kw-teachers img{width:200px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n  .kw-faq{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n  .kw-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3ECF3;border-radius:16px;padding:0 22px}\n  .kw-faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);position:relative;padding-right:30px}\n  .kw-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .kw-faq summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:0;top:14px;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:400}\n  .kw-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n  .kw-faq p{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2)}\n  .kw-rel{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}\n  .kw-rel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D6E6F5;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n  .kw-rel a.main{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .kw-rel a:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n  .kw-rel a.main:hover{color:#fff}\n  .rel-box{margin:0 auto;max-width:1120px;padding:0 40px 90px}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .kw-txt h1{font-size:38px} .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .kw-hero{padding:20px 0 50px}\n    .kw-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}\n    .kw-txt h1{font-size:27px}\n    .kw-lead{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px}\n    .kw-cta a{height:46px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-pic img{border-radius:14px}\n    .kw-sec{padding:60px 0}\n    .kw-whos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-who{padding:22px}\n    .kw-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}\n    .kw-steps li{padding:20px}\n    .kw-table th,.kw-table td{padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}\n    .kw-teachers{gap:10px}\n    .kw-teachers img{width:calc(50% - 5px)}\n    .kw-faq summary{font-size:15px}\n    .rel-box{padding:0 20px 60px}\n  }\n\n  /* ── 반응형 ── */\n  @media (max-width:1100px){\n    .nav > li > a{padding:10px 14px;font-size:15px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:52px}\n    .timing h2{font-size:46px}\n    .feat .head{font-size:40px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    :root{--hd-h:64px}\n    .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n    .nav,.hd-cta{display:none}\n    .burger{display:block}\n    .drawer{display:block}\n    body{padding-bottom:56px}\n    .hero{height:600px;min-height:0;background-image:url(\"/img/hero-m.jpg\");background-position:50% 0;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:56px;text-align:center}\n    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05) 60%)}\n    .hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px}\n    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:18px 0 22px;line-height:1.45}\n    .hero .lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}\n    .timing{padding:70px 0 0}\n    .timing h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}\n    .timing p{font-size:16px;margin-top:16px}\n    .timing .pic{margin-top:36px}\n    .banner .pc{display:none}.banner .m{display:block}\n    .feat{padding:80px 0}\n    .feat .head{font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px}\n    .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even){transform:none}\n    .feat-grid .card:nth-child(even):hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n    .feat-grid::after{display:none}\n    .card{flex-direction:column;padding:30px 26px 32px;min-height:0;gap:18px}\n    .card img{width:60px;height:60px;flex-basis:60px;order:-1}\n    .card .num{font-size:14px}\n    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .card p{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews{padding:60px 0 50px}\n    .reviews .eyebrow{font-size:16px}\n    .reviews h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:30px}\n    .marquee-track{gap:12px;animation-duration:36s}\n    .marquee-track .item,.marquee-track .item img{width:240px}\n    .marquee-track .item img{height:240px}\n    .reviews .cta{font-size:20px;margin-top:44px}\n    .reviews .cta img{width:24px;height:24px}\n    .reviews .mark{font-size:36px;text-align:center;opacity:1;color:var(--blue-light);margin-top:40px}\n    .contact{padding:70px 0}\n    .contact .head h2{font-size:28px}\n    .contact .head p{font-size:15px}\n    .form-card{padding:28px 20px;border-radius:18px}\n    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}\n    .flo-pc{display:none}\n    .flo-m{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n/* ── 일본어 페이지 전용 (이미지: public/img/jp/) ── */\n  main{--accent:#2196F3;--sky:#6AB9F7}\n  .l-kicker{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sky)}\n  .x-hero{margin-top:var(--hd-h);padding:28px 0 0;overflow:hidden}\n  .x-hero .txt{text-align:center;margin-top:60px}\n  .x-hero .txt .sm{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .15s both}\n  .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:60px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue);margin-top:10px;opacity:0;animation:fadeInUp .8s .35s both}\n  .x-hero .txt h1.dark{color:var(--ink)}\n  .x-hero .txt h1.dark em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n  .x-hero .pics{display:grid;gap:24px;margin-top:50px}\n  .x-hero .pics.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .x-hero .pics img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n  .x-sec{padding:120px 0}\n  .x-keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}\n  .x-keys img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .x-keys .row3{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\n  .x-prog{background:#F7F8F9}\n  .x-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:900px;margin:50px auto 0}\n  .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);max-width:1000px}\n  .x-tiles img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 14px 28px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .25s}\n  .x-tiles img:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n  .l-more{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px}\n  .l-more a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:46px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid var(--blue);background:#fff;color:var(--blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;transition:background .2s,color .2s}\n  .l-more a:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}\n  .x-teachers{background:#BADEFB}\n  .t-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:60px}\n  .t-card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 22px 28px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(33,150,243,.4);transition:transform .3s}\n  .t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}\n  .t-card img{width:120px;height:162px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;margin:0 auto 14px}\n  .t-card h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}\n  .t-card .school{font-size:14px;color:#666;margin-top:4px;min-height:42px}\n  .t-card dl{margin:14px 0 0;text-align:left}\n  .t-card dt{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--blue);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;margin:10px 0 6px}\n  .t-card dd{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-2);word-break:keep-all}\n  .x-divider{margin-top:60px}\n  .x-divider img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;opacity:.9}\n  @media (max-width:1100px){ .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:46px} .t-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)} .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)} }\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    .l-kicker{font-size:15px}\n    .x-hero{padding-top:18px}\n    .x-hero .txt{margin-top:34px}\n    .x-hero .txt .sm{font-size:18px}\n    .x-hero .txt h1{font-size:28px}\n    .x-hero .pics,.x-hero .pics.two{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}\n    .x-hero .pics img{border-radius:14px}\n    .x-sec{padding:70px 0}\n    .x-keys{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\n    .x-keys .row3{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\n    .x-tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:30px}\n    .x-tiles.sq{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n    .t-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}\n    .t-card{padding:18px 14px 20px;border-radius:14px}\n    .t-card img{width:90px;height:121px}\n    .t-card h3{font-size:18px}\n    .t-card .school{font-size:12px;min-height:0}\n    .t-card dd{font-size:13px}\n    .x-divider{margin-top:34px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"page-sub\">\n\n<!-- ───────── 헤더 ───────── -->\n<header class=\"hd\" id=\"hd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"레벨업과외 홈\"><img src=\"/img/logo-levelup.png\" alt=\"레벨업과외\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" /></a>\n\n    <!-- ▼ 메뉴 링크: 필요한 주소로 바꾸세요 (드로어 메뉴도 아래 동일하게 수정) -->\n    <ul class=\"nav\">\n      <li><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a>\n        <ul class=\"sub\">\n          <li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a class=\"hd-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n    <button class=\"burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"drawer\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 모바일 드로어 메뉴 -->\n<nav class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"모바일 메뉴\">\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/regions\">과외</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/regions\">지역별 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">고등학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">중학생 수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/regions\">유·초등 수업</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coaching\">학습코칭</a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/coding\">특별프로그램</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/howcoding\">코딩수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/geomjeong\">검정고시</a></li><li><a href=\"/hangeul\">한글수업</a></li><li><a href=\"/camp\">해외캠프/유학</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grp\"><div class=\"grp-row\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">외국어</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grp-tg\" aria-label=\"하위 메뉴 열기\"></button></div>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a></li><li><a href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a></li><li><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"drawer-cta\" href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n<!-- ───────── 외국어 탭 + 히어로 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"ptabs\" aria-label=\"외국어\"><a href=\"/english-conversation\">영어</a><a class=\"on\" href=\"/japanese\">일본어</a><a href=\"/chinese\">중국어</a></nav>\n    <div class=\"txt\">\n      <p class=\"sm\">지금이 바로 일본어 실력 레벨업 타이밍!</p>\n      <h1>日本語を上達させる時間</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pics\"><img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"fadeIn\" src=\"/img/jp/hero.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"헤드폰을 쓰고 노트북으로 일본어 화상 수업을 듣는 학생\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 수업 포인트 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-sec\" id=\"keypoint\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"x-keys\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" src=\"/img/jp/key-1.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"240\" alt=\"다양한 커리큘럼으로 모든 목적 OK: 일상 회화부터 자격증(JLPT/JPT), 유학·취업 준비, 취미 회화까지 모두 가능해요.\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.08s\" src=\"/img/jp/key-2.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"240\" alt=\"수업 포인트 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"row3\">\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.16s\" src=\"/img/jp/key-3.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"240\" alt=\"수업 포인트 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.24s\" src=\"/img/jp/key-4.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"240\" alt=\"수업 포인트 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.32s\" src=\"/img/jp/key-5.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"240\" alt=\"수업 포인트 5\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 1:1 일본어 학습 프로그램 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-sec x-prog\" id=\"program\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">学習プログラム</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">1:1 일본어<br /><em>학습프로그램</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"x-tiles\">\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-1.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 1\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-2.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 2\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-3.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 3\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-4.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 4\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-5.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 5\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-6.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 6\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-7.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 7\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"zoomIn\" src=\"/img/jp/tile-8.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"145\" alt=\"일본어 학습 프로그램 8\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l-more\"><a href=\"#contact\">더보기</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 선생님 소개 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"x-sec x-teachers\" id=\"teachers\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"l-kicker anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">本場の日本語を</span>\n    <h2 class=\"s-h2 center anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\">믿고 배우는 일본어,<br /><em>레벨업의 선생님</em>을 소개합니다!</h2>\n    <div class=\"t-grid\">\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-1.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"히로타 마오 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>히로타 마오</h3><p class=\"school\">일본 국립가가와대학교 (간호학과)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>밝고 긍정적인 한국말 잘하는 일본인 코치 / 일본 도쿄대 / 국립가가와대 15년 근무 / 일본어 강사로 복지센터 등에서 강의 진행 / 초등~성인 / 기초~고급레벨 수업 진행</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-2.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"한유화 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>한유화</h3><p class=\"school\">동국대학교(일어일문학 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / 인증 시험</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>교원자격증 / 긍정적 / 성실하고 적극적 / 고베 거주 / 애니메이션 / 기초 / 비즈니스 / 프리 토킹 수업 등 다양한 분야의 수업 가능 / 스타벅스 재팬 슈퍼 바이저 / 일본어 통번역</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-3.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"마루오 메구미 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>마루오 메구미</h3><p class=\"school\">코난 대학교 (경영학과 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / 인증시험</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국말 잘합니다 / 긍정적 / 한국에서 많은 분들께 일본어를 쉽게 알려드리고 싶습니다. / 기초, 비즈니스, 프리토킹 수업 / 다양한 분야의 수업 가능</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-4.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"최지영 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>최지영</h3><p class=\"school\">중앙대학교(일본어학과 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>긍정적이고 밝은 코치 / 처음 배우는 회원에게도 쉬운 지도 / 자격시험·비즈니스 등 다양한 분야 수업 가능 / 유초등 인기최고</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-5.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"야마모토 나츠코 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>야마모토 나츠코</h3><p class=\"school\">세이료 여자 단기 대학 (경영실무 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>밝고 긍정적인 성격 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-6.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"박선영 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>박선영</h3><p class=\"school\">일어일문 전공(박사), 교원 자격증(일본어)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>밝고 친절한 수업 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-7.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"기요에 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>기요에</h3><p class=\"school\">칸다 외국어 대학 졸업(영어 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국말 잘하는 일본인 / 친절하고 다정한 코치 / 개인 과외 수업 다수 진행 / 초등부터 성인까지 수업 가능 / 기초부터 고급레벨 수업까지 다채로운 수업 가능</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-8.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"이명희 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>이명희</h3><p class=\"school\">계명대(일본어학과), 통역, 시사 일본어 강사</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>풍부한 강의 경험 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-9.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"시기 나오미 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>시기 나오미</h3><p class=\"school\">사이타마 단기대학, 무사시노 은행 근무</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국어 소통 가능 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-10.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"문영주 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>문영주</h3><p class=\"school\">분코 대학 (일본어 일본 문학과), 도쿄 8년거주</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>일본어 초보자 추천 선생님 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-11.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"이시카와 리사 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>이시카와 리사</h3><p class=\"school\">군마 현립 여자 대학 국제 커뮤니케이션 전공</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국어 가능 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-12.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"정지연 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>정지연</h3><p class=\"school\">도쿄 문화 여자대학교</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>기초고급 / 유학 준비 /</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.06s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-13.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"아야코 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>아야코</h3><p class=\"school\">아이치 대학교(비교문화 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>밝고 친절한 수업 / 일본인이지만 한국어 사용 능력 최상 / 일본어 기초 과정 영역별 학습 진행 / 전문적인 수업 진행 / 일본 문화 및 비즈니스 등 다양한 분야의 수업 / 안정적인 수업 추천!</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.12s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-14.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"주미경 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>주미경</h3><p class=\"school\">중앙대학교(일문학 석사), 도시샤대학교</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한일 외국어 학원 강사 / YBM 어학원 강사 / 시사 일본어 강사 / 밝고 친절한 수업 / 다수 학원 강의로 인증시험 및 일반 회화 수업 만족도 높음 / 안정적 수업 추천!</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.18s\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-15.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"시노부 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>시노부</h3><p class=\"school\">코우란 대학교(국제 교양학 전공)</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / JLPT / JPT / SJPT</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>한국 거주 11년차 / 한국어 사용 가능 / 친절하고 신뢰도 있는 수업 / 기초회화~ 비즈니스까지 폭넓은 수업 가능</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"t-card anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n        <img src=\"/img/jp/teacher-16.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"194\" alt=\"유소라 선생님\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <h3>유소라</h3><p class=\"school\">동국대학교(일어일문 졸업), 타이쇼 대학교</p>\n        <dl><dt>수업 가능 영역</dt><dd>일반 회화 / 비즈니스 / 인증시험</dd><dt>코치 장점</dt><dd>긍정적 / 성실하며 모든 일에 열정적 / 일본어 전공 / 캐나다 연수로 일어 영어 다 가능 / 진정성 있는 수업 진행과 일본어를 즐겁게 학습하는데 도움을 주는 코치 / 다양한 분야의 수업 가능</dd></dl>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"x-divider\"><img src=\"/img/jp/divider.png\" width=\"1904\" height=\"57\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 관련 수업 (키워드 페이지) ───────── -->\n<section class=\"kw-alt\" id=\"related\"><div class=\"rel-box\" style=\"padding-top:70px\"><h2 class=\"s-h2\">목적별 <em>일본어 수업</em> 바로가기</h2><div class=\"kw-rel\"><a href=\"/japanese-online\">화상 일본어 과외</a><a href=\"/japanese-jlpt\">JLPT·JPT 과외</a><a href=\"/japanese-business\">비즈니스 일본어 과외</a></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ───────── 무료 모의수업 & 상담 신청 ───────── -->\n<section class=\"sub-cta\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\">무료 모의수업 &amp; 상담 신청</h2>\n    <a class=\"tel anim\" data-anim=\"slideInUp\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\" href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">010-3038-8978</a>\n    <div class=\"form-card on-blue anim\" data-anim=\"fadeInUp\">\n  <form class=\"inq-form\" data-subject=\"일본어\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"form-row\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanese_name\">성함 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><input id=\"f_japanese_name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"성함\" required autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"f_japanese_phone1\">연락처 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n        <div class=\"phone-3\">\n          <input id=\"f_japanese_phone1\" data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"3\" placeholder=\"010\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n          <span class=\"phone-sep\">-</span>\n          <input data-phone type=\"tel\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" placeholder=\"0000\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>희망 과목</label>\n      <div class=\"subj-pick\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"국어\">국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"영어\">영어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"수학\">수학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"사회\">사회</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"과학\">과학</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"선택·탐구\">선택·탐구</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"코딩\">코딩</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"검정고시\">검정고시</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"한글\">한글</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"외국어\" checked>외국어</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"학습코칭\">학습코칭</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"subject\" value=\"해외캠프/유학\">해외캠프/유학</label></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\">\n      <label for=\"f_japanese_postcode\">주소 <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n      <div class=\"addr-row\">\n        <input id=\"f_japanese_postcode\" name=\"postcode\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"우편번호\" readonly />\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"addr-btn\" data-addr-search>주소 찾기</button>\n      </div>\n      <input name=\"addrRoad\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"도로명 주소\" readonly />\n      <input name=\"addrDetail\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"상세주소 (동·호수 등)\" required />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"f_japanese_message\">문의 내용</label><textarea id=\"f_japanese_message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"현재 성적, 고민, 원하는 수업 방식 등을 자유롭게 적어주세요.\"></textarea></div>\n    <!-- 스팸 방지용 숨김 칸 (사람은 채우지 않음) -->\n    <div class=\"hp-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"f_japanese_hp\">홈페이지</label><input id=\"f_japanese_hp\" name=\"hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" /></div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\">상담 신청하기</button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">남겨주신 정보는 상담 안내 목적으로만 사용됩니다.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"form-success\">\n    <div class=\"ok\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"/></svg></div>\n    <h3>신청이 접수되었어요!</h3>\n    <p>확인 후 빠르게 연락드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- ───────── 플로팅 버튼 ───────── -->\n<div class=\"flo-pc\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"카톡상담\"><img src=\"/img/float-kakao.png\" alt=\"카톡상담\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\" aria-label=\"상담신청\"><img src=\"/img/float-inquiry.png\" alt=\"상담신청\" /></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flo-m\" aria-label=\"빠른 상담\">\n  <a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_hzCPG/chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">카톡상담</a>\n  <a href=\"tel:010-3038-8978\">전화상담</a>\n  <a href=\"#contact\">상담신청</a>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  // ── 헤더: 스크롤 시 그림자\n  const hd = byId('hd');\n  const onScroll = () => hd.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);\n  onScroll(); window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n\n  // ── 모바일 메뉴\n  const burger = byId('burger');\n  const closeMenu = () => { document.body.classList.remove('menu-open'); burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); };\n  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const open = document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');\n    burger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer .grp-tg').forEach((b) => {\n    b.addEventListener('click', () => b.closest('.grp').classList.toggle('open'));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer a').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', closeMenu));\n  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (window.innerWidth > 860) closeMenu(); });\n\n  // ── 스크롤 등장 모션 (imweb 위젯 애니메이션과 같은 방식)\n  const animEls = document.querySelectorAll('.anim');\n  if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n    animEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('in'));\n  } else {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach((en) => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });\n    animEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n  }\n\n  // ── 학습후기 무한 슬라이드: 카드를 한 번 더 복제해 끊김 없이 흐르게\n  const track = byId('marqueeTrack');\n  if (track) track.innerHTML += track.innerHTML;\n\n  // ── 상담 신청 폼 (모든 페이지 공통, src/pages/_form.html)\n  // 타고 온 페이지 이름: 제목 앞부분 (메일·시트의 '유입 페이지'에 표시)\n  const pageName = () => (document.title || '').split(/\\s[|·-]\\s/)[0].trim() || (location.pathname === '/' ? '홈' : location.pathname);\n  const onlyDigits = (el) => { el.value = el.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(0, el.maxLength); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('form.inq-form').forEach((form) => {\n    const $ = (sel) => form.querySelector(sel);\n    const card = form.closest('.form-card');\n    const success = card ? card.querySelector('.form-success') : null;\n    const parts = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[data-phone]')];\n    // 전화번호: 3-4-4 세 칸, 다 채우면 다음 칸으로 자동 이동 (지우면 이전 칸으로)\n    parts.forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.addEventListener('input', () => { onlyDigits(el); if (el.value.length >= el.maxLength && i < parts.length - 1) parts[i + 1].focus(); });\n      el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Backspace' && el.value === '' && i > 0) parts[i - 1].focus(); });\n    });\n    // 주소 찾기 (다음 우편번호 → 도로명주소)\n    const addrBtn = $('[data-addr-search]');\n    if (addrBtn) addrBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (typeof daum === 'undefined' || !daum.Postcode) { alert('주소 검색을 불러오지 못했어요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.'); return; }\n      new daum.Postcode({ oncomplete: (d) => {\n        $('[name=\"postcode\"]').value = d.zonecode || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value = d.roadAddress || d.address || '';\n        $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus();\n      } }).open();\n    });\n    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const f = form.elements;\n      const name = f['name'].value.trim();\n      const nameLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"name\"]') || {}).textContent || '학생 이름';\n      const phoneLabel = (form.querySelector('label[for$=\"phone1\"]') || {}).textContent || '학부모 연락처';\n      if (!name){ f['name'].focus(); alert(nameLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '을(를) 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const v = parts.map((el) => el.value);\n      if (v[0].length !== 3 || v[1].length !== 4 || v[2].length !== 4){\n        (v[0].length !== 3 ? parts[0] : v[1].length !== 4 ? parts[1] : parts[2]).focus();\n        alert(phoneLabel.replace('*','').trim() + '를 정확히 입력해주세요. (예: 010-1234-5678)'); return;\n      }\n      const road = $('[name=\"addrRoad\"]').value.trim(), detail = $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').value.trim();\n      if (!road){ addrBtn.focus(); alert('주소 찾기로 도로명 주소를 선택해주세요.'); return; }\n      if (!detail){ $('[name=\"addrDetail\"]').focus(); alert('상세주소를 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n      const address = '[' + ($('[name=\"postcode\"]').value.trim() || '-') + '] ' + road + ', ' + detail;\n      const subjects = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"subject\"]:checked')].map((c) => c.value);\n      if (!subjects.length && form.dataset.subject) subjects.push(form.dataset.subject);\n      const payload = { name, phone: v.join('-'), grade: f['grade'] ? f['grade'].value : '', subjects, address, message: f['message'].value.trim(), hp: f['hp'].value, page: pageName() + ' · ' + location.pathname };\n      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n      const label = btn.textContent; btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '보내는 중...';\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/inquiry', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload) });\n        const out = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\n        if (!res.ok || !out.ok) throw new Error(out.error || '잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.');\n        form.style.display = 'none';\n        if (success) { success.classList.add('show'); success.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' }); }\n      } catch (err) {\n        alert('전송 중 문제가 발생했어요. ' + err.message);\n        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = label;\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n{{ANTICOPY}}\n</body>\n</html>\n"}};
export const PAGE_PATHS = Object.keys(PAGES);
